 ["< Back"] = "< 返回",
 ["A **trigger** is an occasion — something happening that you want to feel. A **mode** is a feeling — the shape of the vibration itself.\n\nEvery trigger plays one mode, and many triggers share one. You can customize this relationship at two levels:\n\n**Per-cue customization**: Enable advanced controls to change what a specific cue \"Feels like\" from its dropdown, or adjust its individual intensity slider without affecting other cues.\n\n**Motor & Timing page**: Reshape any vibration mode across the entire addon — adjust its low motor or high motor balance, and speed up or slow down its duration envelope."] = "**触发器**是触发的时机——即你希望感知到的游戏内事件。**模式**是震动的体感——即震动本身的形态。\n\n每个触发器对应播放一种模式，且多个触发器可共享同一种模式。你可以在两个层级自定义此映射关系：\n\n**按提示独立自定义**：启用高级控件，即可在各提示专属的下拉菜单中修改其“体感”形态，或调整其独立的强度滑块，而不会影响其他提示。\n\n**马达与时间节奏页面**：在全局范围内重构任意震动模式——调整其重震马达与轻震马达的平衡，并加快或放缓其持续时间包络。",
 ["A barely-there fade, for the quietest ambient onset."] = "几乎难以察觉的淡入淡出，用于最轻柔微弱的环境感官起振。",
 ["A bed you feel for the length of a craft, with the profession's own work rhythm struck over it. While a craft is running this replaces |cffffd100Casting texture|r rather than layering with it, so one action is one sensation.\n\nThe profession is read from the recipe by id, so it does not depend on your language. Anything that does not resolve still gets a generic work rhythm rather than going quiet."] = "制造期间持续感知的基底震颤，其上叠加了该专业特有的劳作节奏。在制造进行时，此效果会替换|cffffd100施法材质震动|r而非与之叠加，从而确保一次动作仅对应一种体感。\n\n专业信息通过配方ID直接读取，因此不依赖你所使用的语言。任何未能识别的配方仍会获得通用的工作节奏，而不会陷入静音。",
 ["A bright chime when gathering an herb node, mineral vein, or skinning loot completes."] = "当采集草药点、矿脉或完成剥皮拾取时，产生清脆的鸣响提示。",
 ["A bright tick when an item enters your bags — looted, crafted, or mailed."] = "当物品进入你的背包时（无论是拾取、制造还是邮件获得），产生清脆的提示震动。",
 ["A bright tick when something you could interact with — an NPC, a node, a door — comes under your reticle."] = "当可交互对象（NPC、采集点、门等）进入你的准星时，产生清脆的提示震动。",
