 ["A dense three-pulse tactical flurry when the client receives UNIT_SPELLCAST_SUCCEEDED for Windfury Attack (Spell ID 25504)."] = "当客户端接收到风怒攻击（法术ID 25504）的UNIT_SPELLCAST_SUCCEEDED事件时，产生密集的3脉冲战术疾风连击。",
 ["A distinct physical tap to land with each main-hand weapon swing."] = "主手武器每次挥动命中时，产生明确的实体轻触震动。",
 ["A distinct tap when holding the controller modifier to target party or raid members."] = "按住手柄组合修饰键以选择小队或团队成员时，产生清晰的轻触震动。",
 ["A dry click when you use an ability that has no cast time."] = "使用瞬发技能时，产生干脆的轻按震动。",
 ["A faint constant on the slow motor for as long as a cast or channel lasts, underneath the swell. This is the part that says \"something is happening\"; the swell is the part that says \"it is nearly done\". Zero leaves only the swell."] = "在施法或引导持续期间，重震马达在渐强震动之下维持微弱的恒定震动。这部分负责传达“正在施法”；渐强部分则传达“即将完成”。设为0则仅保留渐强震动。",
 ["A faint continuous hum for as long as you're casting or channelling."] = "在施法或引导持续期间，产生微弱的持续嗡鸣震动。",
 ["A falling pulse when the controller hands control back to your character."] = "当手柄将控制权交还给你的角色时，产生渐弱的震动脉冲。",
 ["A falling pulse when the radial menu closes."] = "当轮盘菜单关闭时，产生渐弱的震动脉冲。",
 ["A few triggers, in both the game-feel and Accessibility parts of the panel, rest on questions about the game that have no settled answer yet.\n\nWhen one of them fails it does not produce an error. It simply never fires, and there is nothing to fix. They may also change or stop working after any game update.\n\nTry them if you're curious. Don't build a habit on one."] = "在面板的“游戏体感”与“辅助功能”部分中，有少数触发器依赖于游戏中尚无明确结论的底层机制。\n\n当其中某个触发器失效时，并不会产生报错。它只是单纯不再触发，也无需修复。在游戏版本更新后，它们也可能会发生变化或停止工作。\n\n如果你感到好奇可以随心尝试，但请不要对其养成操作依赖。",
 ["A firm hit that bleeds away — slowing to a stop."] = "一次扎实的重击并逐渐消退——缓缓停止。",
