 ["A pleasant chime whenever your shapeshift form changes."] = "每当你的变形形态改变时，产生悦耳的鸣响提示。",
 ["A quick tap when a boss raid-warns, yells, emotes, or whispers during a fight — a text-channel fallback for bossAbilityWarning above."] = "首领在战斗中发送团队警告、喊道、动作表情或密语时，产生迅速的轻触震动——作为上述bossAbilityWarning的文本频道备用方案。",
 ["A ringing anvil strike when repairing armor and weapons at a vendor."] = "在商人处修理护甲与武器时，产生铁砧敲击的清脆鸣响震动。",
 ["A rising celebratory surge when you gain a level."] = "提升等级时，产生逐渐增强的庆祝跃动震感。",
 ["A rising pulse when the controller radial menu opens."] = "当手柄轮盘菜单打开时，产生渐强的震动脉冲。",
