 ["A soft tick when releasing the group targeting modifier back to normal navigation."] = "松开小队目标修饰键恢复正常导航时，产生柔和的轻微提示震动。",
 ["A soft tick when the item leaves the cursor."] = "当物品离开光标时，产生柔和的提示震动。",
 ["A soft tick when you cancel a radial selection instead of committing to it."] = "取消轮盘选择而非确认时，产生柔和的轻微提示震动。",
 ["A soft tick when you dismount."] = "下马时产生柔和的提示跳动。",
 ["A soft tick when you start auto-attacking with a ranged weapon (Auto Shot, Shoot, wands)."] = "使用远程武器开始自动攻击（自动射击、射击、魔杖）时，产生柔和的轻微提示震动。",
 ["A soft tick when you start meleeing."] = "开始近战自动攻击时，产生柔和的轻微提示震动。",
 ["A soft tick when you start resting in an inn or major city."] = "在旅店或主城进入休息状态时，产生柔和的轻微提示震动。",
 ["A soft tick when your melee auto-attack stops — catches walking out of range or a target dying without noticing."] = "近战自动攻击停止时产生柔和的轻微提示震动——用于提示走出近战范围或未注意到的目标死亡。",
 ["A soft tick when your ranged auto-attack stops — catches walking out of range or getting interrupted without noticing."] = "当你的远程自动射击停止时产生轻柔的提示震动——用于提示不经意间超出距离或被意外打断。",
 ["A soft, quick tick."] = "柔和短促的轻微提示震动。",
 ["A solid tap when buying an item from a merchant."] = "从商人处购买物品时，产生沉稳的轻触震动。",
 ["A steady, low ambient texture."] = "平稳的低频环境氛围震感。",
 ["A steady, stronger texture — meant to be scaled by the caller (e.g. speed)."] = "平稳且更强烈的材质震感——供调用方缩放调节（例如根据速度）。",
 ["A strong impulse of thrust as your flight path mount launches into the air."] = "当飞行路线坐骑腾空起飞时，产生强劲的推力脉冲。",
 ["A subtle thud when a consumable or item is used and empties a bag slot."] = "当使用消耗品或物品并清空一个背包格子时，产生微妙的顿挫震动。",
 ["A subtle tick when stepping within auto-attack melee range of your target."] = "进入目标的自动攻击近战范围时，产生微妙的提示跳动。",
 ["A tactile click when native gamepad or action targeting triggers an interaction with the soft target."] = "当原生手柄或动作目标锁定触发与软目标的交互时，产生触感明确的点击震动。",
 ["A tactile micro-tick each time the stack splitter quantity slider changes."] = "拆分堆叠数量滑块每次改变时，产生触感微小的提示震动。",
 ["A tactile recoil kick on every Auto Shot arrow, timed to the real shot, not estimated."] = "每次自动射击箭矢射出时产生真实的后坐力冲击，精确同步于实际射击时刻，而非估算。",
 ["A tank-facing cue. Off by default because for anyone else losing threat is the normal, desirable state."] = "面向坦克的专属提示。默认关闭，因为对其他任何职责来说，脱离仇恨才是正常且期望的状态。",
 ["A tap when a confirmation dialog opens."] = "确认对话框弹出时产生轻触震动。",
 ["A tap when an NPC or world object opens a window nothing else here covers."] = "NPC或世界物体打开未被其他项涵盖的窗口时产生轻触震动。",
 ["A texture that builds as your gliding speed climbs toward a boost."] = "随着滑翔速度提升接近加速时逐渐增强的材质震感。",
 ["A tick when a book, plaque, gravestone or signpost opens to be read."] = "打开书籍、牌匾、墓碑或路标阅读时产生轻微提示震动。",
 ["A tick when a piece of your gear's durability drops into the low or broken range."] = "某件装备的耐久度降至过低或损坏区间时产生轻微提示震动。",
 ["A tiny blip when you gain experience."] = "获得经验值时产生微弱短促的提示震动。",
 ["A tiny low blip, for things that happen often."] = "适用于频繁发生事件的微弱低频轻颤。",
 ["A triumphant dual-tone chime when you earn an achievement."] = "获得成就时产生凯旋的双音调清鸣震动。",
 ["A very light micro-pulse."] = "极轻微的微脉冲震动。",
 ["A very light tap for an ordinary heal — deliberately gentle, distinct from the sharper healCrit pulse."] = "普通治疗产生极轻微的轻触震动——特意设计得较为柔和，有别于更加强烈的healCrit爆击脉冲。",
 ["A very light tap for an ordinary hit — deliberately gentle, distinct from the sharper critLanded pulse."] = "普通命中产生极轻微的轻触震动——特意设计得较为柔和，有别于更加强烈的critLanded爆击脉冲。",
 ["A very light tick each time controller focus moves to a different interface element."] = "每次手柄焦点移动到不同的界面元素时，产生极轻微的提示震动。",
 ["A very light tick every time you use an ability, while in combat."] = "在战斗中，每次使用技能都会产生极轻微的提示震动。",
 ["A very light tick per combo point, building toward a full resource."] = "每个连击点数产生极轻微的提示震动，向满资源递增。",
 ["A very light tick per segment as you sweep the stick around the radial — the wheel gets detents you can feel."] = "转动摇杆划过轮盘时，每个扇区都会产生极轻微的提示震动——赋予轮盘清晰可触的阻尼刻度感。",
 ["A very light tick when a friendly unit comes under your reticle."] = "当友方单位进入你的准星时，产生极轻微的提示跳动。",
 ["A very light tick when something you could attack comes under your reticle."] = "当可攻击目标进入你的准星时，产生极轻微的提示跳动。",
 ["A very light tick when you loot money."] = "当你拾取金钱时，产生极轻微的提示震动。",
 ["A very light tick when your equipped gear changes."] = "已装备的装备发生变更时产生极轻微的提示震动。",
 ["A very short, sharp tick when you avoid an incoming attack."] = "避开敌人攻击（闪避/招架/未命中）时产生极短促清脆的提示震动。",
 ["ACTIONBAR_PAGE_CHANGED. Useful on a controller specifically, where the bar you're on isn't always where your eyes are. Does not cover the vehicle/override/possess bar swaps, which are their own events and would want their own cue if they turn out to matter."] = "ACTIONBAR_PAGE_CHANGED（动作条翻页）。对手柄操作尤为实用，因为视线不一定总停留在当前的动作条上。本提示不包含载具/覆盖/控制动作条的切换，那些属于独立事件，若有必要可为其配置专属提示。",
 ["ACTIVE"] = "已激活",
 ["AFK or DND toggled"] = "暂离或请勿打扰状态切换",
 ["Ability pulse"] = "技能脉冲",
 ["Accept"] = "接受",
 ["Achievement earned"] = "获得成就",
 ["Action bar page changed"] = "动作条分页已切换",
 ["Action bars"] = "动作条",
 ["Action failed"] = "动作失败",
 ["Action feedback"] = "动作反馈",
 ["Activate"] = "激活",
 ["Active"] = "激活",
 ["Active Profile: |cffffd100%s|r"] = "当前配置文件：|cffffd100%s|r",
 ["Active Profile: |cffffd100%s|r |cffff8800(Pending exit from combat)|r"] = "当前配置文件：|cffffd100%s|r |cffff8800(等待脱离战斗)|r",
 ["Active profile"] = "当前配置文件",
 ["Actuator profile: %s\n%s"] = "执行器配置文件：%s\n%s",
 ["Addon language"] = "插件语言",
 ["Adds a row under each cue that plays it, so you can find out what something feels like without waiting for it to happen. Useful while tuning, but it doubles the length of every page. The mode tester below still works either way. Takes effect immediately — no /reload needed."] = "在每个提示下方添加一行试听按钮，无需等待游戏内事件发生即可体验其实际体感。在调校时非常实用，但这会使每个页面的长度翻倍。无论是否开启，下方的模式测试器均可正常使用。立即生效——无需 /reload。",
 ["Adds each cue's own intensity slider, \"Feels like\" shape picker and any bespoke dials to its page. On by default: uncheck for a compact one-line list that is easier to read when you just want to switch cues on and off. Takes effect immediately in this panel — no /reload needed."] = "在页面中为每个提示显示独立的强度滑块、“体感”形态选择器以及所有专属调节项。默认开启：若你仅需快速开启或关闭提示，取消勾选可显示更易于浏览的紧凑单行列表。在此面板中立即生效——无需 /reload。",
 ["Adjust your global master vibration strength. Individual cues can always be fine-tuned in settings."] = "调节全局主震动强度。单个提示的强度始终可以在设置中进行微调。",
 ["Advanced Settings"] = "高级设置",
 ["Alchemy"] = "炼金术",
 ["Also fires when you cancel a cast yourself, or move out of range — it means \"your cast did not finish\", not specifically \"you were kicked\"."] = "当你自行取消施法或移出范围时也会触发——它的含义是“你的施法未能完成”，而非特指“你被法术反制/打断”。",
 ["Also fires when you switch to a target that is already mid-cast."] = "切换至正在施法中的目标时也会触发。",
 ["Alternates between the motors — an unsteady, rolling feel."] = "在不同马达之间交替——营造不稳定、翻滚的体感。",
 ["Alternating low thud and high snap across motors."] = "在马达间交替出现低频重击与高频抽击。",
 ["Ambient weather, world dialogs, merchant/mail"] = "环境天气、世界对话、商人/邮件",
 ["An electric burst when a reactive spell or talent lights up on your action bar."] = "当触发类法术或天赋在动作条上高亮激活时，产生触电般的脉冲爆发。",
 ["An urgent stutter vibration when your bags become full or when you attempt an action with a full inventory."] = "当你的背包已满或尝试在背包已满时执行操作，产生急促的断续颤动。",
 ["Anatomical lub-dub cardiac rhythm."] = "解剖学生理特征的“砰-咚”（lub-dub）心律震颤。",
 ["Any other window"] = "任何其他窗口",
 ["Anything else"] = "其他任何内容",
 ["Applies only while this character is in this specialization. Switching specialization switches profile with it, with no further action from you."] = "仅当此角色处于该专精时生效。切换专精将自动随之切换配置文件，无需任何额外操作。",
 ["Applies to this character whatever specialization it is in. This is the rule the profile picker on the Pulse page has always written to."] = "无论该角色处于何种专精均生效。这是 Pulse 页面上的配置文件选择器一直以来写入的规则。",
 ["Apply"] = "应用",
 ["Apply parry haste"] = "应用招架加速",
 ["Apply the \"%s\" starting point? This overwrites every motor's strength, floor, timing and curve with that controller's values — any trimming you have already done is lost."] = "是否应用“%s”初始预设？这将使用该手柄的配置覆盖每个马达的强度、启转阈值、时间节奏与响应曲线——你此前所作的任何微调都将丢失。",
 ["Asks the controller what it is and suggests a row from the list above. Only prints a suggestion — it never selects or applies anything for you."] = "检测手柄型号并在上方列表中给出推荐项。仅输出建议——绝不会自动为你选择或应用任何设置。",
 ["Asymmetric oceanic gravity swells and coastal wave surges while swimming in the sea."] = "在海中游泳时产生非对称的海洋重力涌浪与海岸波浪起伏。",
 ["Atmospheric and arcane. Flowing spellcast textures, elemental channeling, environmental wind and weather, flight gliding, and magical world interactions."] = "氛围与奥术沉浸。流畅的施法材质震动、元素引导、环境风雨天气、飞行滑翔以及魔法世界的交互反馈。",
 ["Attack time (s)"] = "起振时间 (秒)",
 ["Attentive triage. Emergency low health warnings, dispel/CC alerts, kick warnings, and heal completion confirmation with subdued personal damage."] = "专注救急支援。紧急低生命值预警、驱散/控制警报、打断警报以及治疗完成确认，同时降低自身承受伤害的提示干扰。",
 ["Auction house opened"] = "拍卖行已打开",
 ["Auto Shot fired"] = "自动射击已发射",
 ["Auto-shot cadence, weapon swings, pet status, trap triggers, execute range, boss mechanics"] = "自动射击节奏、武器挥动、宠物状态、陷阱触发、斩杀血线、首领机制",
 ["Auto-switch in %s"] = "在 %s 中自动切换",
 ["Automatic — game language"] = "自动 — 游戏语言",
 ["Automatically switch to %s whenever this character is in this specialization."] = "每当该角色处于此专精时，自动切换至 %s。",
 ["Balances this motor against the others. Raise it if this motor is the weak one on your controller, lower it if it drowns everything else out. This is the knob the old \"Low Motor Only\"/\"High Motor Only\" schemas were being misused for — those still exist, but for a motor that is actually dead, not merely quieter."] = "平衡该马达与其他马达的出力。若该马达在手柄上表现较弱请调高；若其震感过强掩盖了其他效果请调低。过去旧的“仅重震马达”/“仅轻震马达”震动方案常被误用于此——这些方案仍然存在，但只适用于马达彻底失效的情况，而非仅仅偏弱。",
 ["Bank gold transfer"] = "银行金币存取",
 ["Bank opened"] = "银行已打开",
 ["Base strength of rain drops on the light motor."] = "轻震马达上雨滴击打的基础强度。",
 ["Battle.net whisper received"] = "收到 Battle.net 密语",
 ["Battleground queue ready"] = "战场排队就绪",
 ["Bed strength"] = "底震强度",
 ["Bends the motor response with a smoothstep curve (3x^2 - 2x^3) to widen contrast between gentle background textures and heavy combat impacts. When unchecked, standard linear scaling is used."] = "使用平滑过渡曲线（3x^2 - 2x^3）调节马达响应，以拉大柔和背景材质震动与剧烈战斗撞击之间的对比度。未勾选时，使用标准线性缩放。",
 ["Bends the relationship between what a cue asks for and what the motor is told. Below 1.0 makes quiet cues louder; above 1.0 makes them quieter and reserves more of the range for strong ones. 1.0 is the unbent default."] = "调节提示请求强度与马达实际输出之间的响应曲线。低于1.0会放大微弱提示；高于1.0会削弱微弱提示并将更多动态范围留给强烈冲击。1.0 为未作调节的默认值。",
 ["Blacksmithing"] = "锻造",
 ["Boss ability warning"] = "首领技能预警",
 ["Boss chat warning"] = "首领喊话预警",
 ["Boss encounter ended"] = "首领战结束",
 ["Boss encounter started"] = "首领战开始",
 ["Boss mechanics, heavy damage taken, personal cooldowns, debuffs, execute range, interrupt windows"] = "首领机制、承受重度伤害、个人自保冷却技能、减益效果、斩杀血线、打断时机",
 ["Both rumble motors work normally. Start here, then balance their strength on the Controller calibration page."] = "两个震动马达均正常工作。建议从此项开始，然后在“手柄校准”页面平衡它们的强度。",
 ["Bound to the right-stick press in Blizzard's own radial."] = "绑定至暴雪原生轮盘中的右摇杆按下。",
 ["Bracketed by PLAYER_CONTROL_LOST/GAINED filtered to UnitOnTaxi — those events also fire for other control-loss cases (e.g. fear), filtered out here."] = "由 PLAYER_CONTROL_LOST/GAINED 事件界定，并通过 UnitOnTaxi 过滤——这些事件也会在其他失控情况（如恐惧）下触发，此处已将其过滤排除。",
 ["Breakaway floor"] = "启转阈值",
 ["Breath Depletion"] = "呼吸消耗",
 ["Breath depth"] = "呼吸深度",
 ["Breath rate (Hz)"] = "呼吸频率 (Hz)",
 ["Breath texture stays completely silent (no ambient, no gasps) while breath remaining is above this — requested live 2026-09-16 as ~70% breath remaining, well before real danger, so the calm bradycardic heartbeat has room to establish before anything steepens."] = "当剩余呼吸高于此阈值时，呼吸纹理保持完全静音（无环境水声，无喘息）——根据 2026-09-16 实机测试需求设为约 70% 剩余呼吸，远早于真正危险发生之前，以便在心率陡增之前让平缓的心动过缓心跳有足够铺垫空间。",
 ["Brings Blizzard's native gamepad interface alive under your thumbs:\n• |cffffffffRadial & Menus:|r Soft tactile micro-taps as your stick moves across buttons and tabs.\n• |cffffffffWindows:|r Physical confirmation when opening bags, merchant shops, banks, and mail.\n• |cffffffffDialogs & Prompts:|r Tactile prompt when NPC interaction windows or quest frames appear."] = "让暴雪原生手柄界面在你的指尖栩栩如生：\n• |cffffffff轮盘与菜单：|r摇杆滑过按钮和标签页时产生柔和的微触感震动。\n• |cffffffff窗口：|r打开背包、商人店铺、银行和邮箱时产生明确的确认震动。\n• |cffffffff对话与提示：|rNPC交互窗口或任务面板出现时产生触觉提示。",
 ["Builds from a low hum into a high pulse."] = "从低频嗡鸣逐渐增强为高频脉冲。",
 ["CLICK %s:LeftButton"] = "CLICK %s:LeftButton",
 ["COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE's SPELL_AURA_START_HARMFUL messageType, ruling out EXTRA_ATTACKS. Occurrence only — the amount on this feed is a secret value. Not confirmed to fire; off by default."] = "COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE的SPELL_AURA_START_HARMFUL消息类型，排除了EXTRA_ATTACKS。仅检测发生与否——该数据流中的数值属于私密值。尚未确认是否触发；默认关闭。",
 ["CURSOR_CHANGED, with C_Cursor.GetCursorItem() checked only for presence — never read, never compared, so a secret item can't break it (truthiness on a non-secret-boolean is legal). Distinct from this addon's own \"Item obtained\": that's loot arriving in your bags, this is you physically holding something."] = "CURSOR_CHANGED 事件，仅通过 C_Cursor.GetCursorItem() 检查物品是否存在——绝不读取或比较具体内容，因此隐藏物品不会引发异常（对非保密布尔值进行真值判断是完全合法的）。与本插件自身的“获得物品”不同：后者是指战利品进入背包，而此处是指你实际上用鼠标拿起了物品。",
 ["C_Weather/WEATHER_CHANGED is new as of Patch 12.1.5 and its exact return shape hasn't been verified in-game here — this fires on any change, not filtered to storm-type weather yet."] = "C_Weather/WEATHER_CHANGED 为 12.1.5 补丁新增接口，其实机返回值结构在此处尚未完全验证——目前会在任何天气变化时触发，暂未单独筛选暴风雨类天气。",
 ["Calibrated for standard third-party ERM rumble curves"] = "针对标准第三方 ERM 震动曲线校准",
 ["Cancel"] = "取消",
 ["Captures the active vibration level from a running Ramp sweep and writes it directly to this motor's Breakaway floor slider below, then stops the ramp. Press this the moment you first feel the motor move!"] = "从正在运行的渐变测试中捕获当前震动强度，直接写入下方该马达的“启转阈值”滑块，随后停止测试。一旦初次感觉到马达震动，请立即点击此项！",
 ["Cast flow, flight & skyriding, swimming, weather changes, quest and item haptics"] = "施法节奏、飞行与驭龙术、游泳、天气变化、任务与物品触觉",
 ["Cast outcomes"] = "施法结果",
 ["Cast presence (low)"] = "施法常驻感 (低频)",
 ["Cast sent"] = "施法请求已发送",
 ["Cast swell peak (high)"] = "施法渐强峰值 (高频)",
 ["Cast texture, cast finish confirmation, lockout/pushback warnings, proc glows, kick alerts"] = "施法材质震动、施法完成确认、沉默/推迟施法预警、触发高亮、打断警报",
 ["Casting"] = "正在施法",
 ["Casting texture"] = "施法材质震动",
 ["Change threshold"] = "变更阈值",
 ["Channel hum (high)"] = "引导法术嗡鸣（高频）",
 ["Character & Status"] = "角色与状态",
 ["Character state"] = "角色状态",
 ["Checked via C_UnitAuras.AuraIsBigDefensive. Occurrence only."] = "通过 C_UnitAuras.AuraIsBigDefensive 检查。仅在发生时触发。",
 ["Choose the addon display language. Automatic follows the game client. Missing translations use English. Changes apply after /reload."] = "选择插件显示语言。“自动”将跟随游戏客户端语言。缺失的本地化文本将回退显示为英文。更改在重载界面（/reload）后生效。",
 ["Choose whether gamepad menu navigation and group communication produce controller vibration."] = "选择手柄菜单导航和小队沟通是否产生手柄震动。",
 ["Choose your planned class & role, and configure offensive and defensive combat feedback."] = "选择你计划的职业与职责，并配置进攻与防御战斗反馈。",
 ["Clears any vibration still in flight when the controller disconnects."] = "手柄断开连接时，清除所有正在执行的震动。",
 ["Click to open settings"] = "点击打开设置",
 ["Climbs this motor slowly from silence to %d%% power over %d seconds, "] = "使该马达从静音缓慢攀升至 %d%% 功率，历时 %d 秒，",
 ["Close"] = "关闭",
 ["Combat"] = "战斗",
