 ["Combat texture"] = "战斗材质",
 ["Combo point gained"] = "获得连击点数",
 ["Combo points, resource cap, execute range, kick alert, boss telegraphs, burst cooldowns"] = "连击点数、资源上限、斩杀血线、打断预警、首领技能预警、爆发冷却技能",
 ["Commanding protection. High threat alerts, mitigation tracking, crowd control, and kick windows. Silences non-combat clutter."] = "掌控与守护。高仇恨预警、减伤监控、控制技能与打断时机。静音非战斗冗余震动。",
 ["Companion tools"] = "配套工具",
 ["Competitive & Baseline"] = "竞技与基础",
 ["Complements rather than duplicates a \"resource full\" cue — this ticks on every point, not just the cap. Reads UnitPower(\"player\", Enum.PowerType.ComboPoints) via UNIT_POWER_UPDATE, firing only when the count increases — confirmed live 2026-09-16 that this event also fires on the drop back to 0 after a finisher, so an unfiltered version would tick on that reset too. An ability that grants more than one point in a single event ticks once, not once per point — a simplification, not confirmed against every point-granting ability."] = "与“资源已满”提示互为补充而非重复——本提示在每获得一点资源时均会震动，而非仅在达到上限时触发。通过 UnitPower(\"player\", Enum.PowerType.ComboPoints) 读取 UNIT_POWER_UPDATE，仅在点数增加时触发——2026-09-16实机确认该事件在施放终结技后点数回落至0时同样会触发，因此未经筛选的版本在重置时也会震动。单次事件中赋予多个点数的技能只会震动一次，而非按点数逐次震动——这属于设计简化，尚未针对所有获取点数的技能进行穷尽测试。",
 ["Configure tactile rewards for exploring Azeroth and sensory spatial awareness for targeting."] = "配置探索艾泽拉斯的触觉奖励以及用于目标选择的空间感知震动。",
 ["Confirmation popup appeared"] = "确认弹窗出现",
 ["Confirmation popup closed"] = "确认弹窗关闭",
 ["Confirmed live 2026-09-17: PLAYER_ENTER_COMBAT/PLAYER_LEAVE_COMBAT specifically track the auto-attack toggle, not the broader in-combat state combatEnter/combatLeave already cover — kept as its own cue pair rather than merged with autoRepeatStart/Stop, since melee and ranged are a different event pair on a different frame."] = "2026-09-17实机确认：PLAYER_ENTER_COMBAT/PLAYER_LEAVE_COMBAT专用于追踪自动攻击开关，而非combatEnter/combatLeave已涵盖的更广泛战斗状态——作为独立的提示配对保留，而非合并至autoRepeatStart/Stop，因为近战和远程在不同框架上对应不同的事件对。",
 ["Confirmed live 2026-09-17: START_AUTOREPEAT_SPELL/STOP_AUTOREPEAT_SPELL fire reliably on this client. See meleeAttackStart for the separate melee equivalent."] = "2026-09-17实机确认：START_AUTOREPEAT_SPELL/STOP_AUTOREPEAT_SPELL在此客户端上稳定触发。独立的近战等效事件请参阅meleeAttackStart。",
 ["Confirmed live 2026-09-17: UNIT_SPELLCAST_SUCCEEDED fires with spellID 75 once per arrow — a genuine per-shot signal, not a prediction. Melee auto-attack has no equivalent: the traditional swing-timer technique reads the combat log, and this same session confirmed COMBAT_LOG_EVENT_UNFILTERED errors on registration for an addon frame under Midnight, full stop. See weaponSwingMain/weaponSwingOff below for the estimated (not measured) melee equivalent, built anyway with that limitation stated plainly. Hunter-specific; other classes' ranged auto-repeat (Shoot, wands) untested."] = "2026-09-17实机确认：UNIT_SPELLCAST_SUCCEEDED每支箭都会触发一次（法术ID 75）——属于真实可靠的单发信号，而非估算。近战自动攻击没有直接等效事件：传统的挥动计时器技术需要读取战斗日志，而同一测试已完全证实Midnight架构下插件框架注册COMBAT_LOG_EVENT_UNFILTERED会报错。下方weaponSwingMain/weaponSwingOff即为估算（非实测）的近战替代方案，在此明确说明该局限性。本项仅限猎人；其他职业的远程自动重复攻击（射击、魔杖）未经测试。",
 ["Confirmed live, 2026-09-15: COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE's DAMAGE_CRIT/SPELL_DAMAGE_CRIT fires when you are crit, not when you land one — the reverse of this cue's original name and description. The `critLanded` id and COMBAT category are kept as-is rather than renamed, so this stays the same saved preference for anyone who already toggled it."] = "2026-09-15实机确认：COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE的DAMAGE_CRIT/SPELL_DAMAGE_CRIT是在你被暴击时触发，而非你打出暴击时——与该提示原本的名称和描述恰好相反。保留`critLanded`标识符和COMBAT类别不变而不作重命名，以便此前已调整过设置的玩家保留偏好。",
 ["Confused or possessed"] = "迷乱或被心控",
 ["Continuous atmospheric vibration matching the current weather (rain, snow, sandstorm) and its intensity."] = "匹配当前天气（雨、雪、沙尘暴）及其强度的持续环境氛围震动。",
 ["Continuous magical hum that builds during casts and channels steadily through your hands."] = "在施法期间逐渐增强并通过双手平稳传导的持续法术嗡鸣。",
 ["Continuous textures"] = "持续震动材质",
 ["Control & Threat"] = "控制与仇恨",
 ["Controller"] = "手柄",
 ["Controller Interactions"] = "手柄交互",
 ["Controller UI"] = "手柄界面",
 ["Controller UI & Window Feedback"] = "手柄界面与窗口反馈",
 ["Controller battery low"] = "手柄电量过低",
 ["Controller calibration"] = "手柄校准",
 ["Controller connected"] = "手柄已连接",
 ["Controller disconnected"] = "手柄已断开",
 ["Controllers differ in which motors they have, and the game never reports whether a vibration actually happened. Nothing can detect this for you, so you have to feel it.\n\nPick a mode from the **Mode to test** dropdown near the top of the panel and press **Play**. Try a few — sharp ones, sustained ones, textures. Pay attention to which ones you can feel clearly, which are faint, and which do not arrive at all.\n\nIf some were missing or silent, check two places:\n\nThe **Vibration schema** dropdown near the top of the panel. A schema decides which motor each pulse drives, and swapping it works around a controller that only drives one of them.\n\nThe **Controller calibration** page. Real motors need a minimum amount of power just to start spinning (their breakaway floor). If quiet cues vanish entirely, use the **Ramp** tool there to calibrate your motor floors and balance their strength."] = "不同手柄搭载的马达类型各异，而且游戏永远不会向系统回报震动是否真正触发。没有任何程序能替你侦测这一点，因此必须由你亲自感知。\n\n从面板顶部附近的**测试模式**下拉菜单中选择一个模式，然后点击**播放**。多试几种——清脆的、持续的、材质纹理震动。留意哪些能清晰感受到、哪些微弱、哪些完全没有动静。\n\n如果有部分震动缺失或静音，请检查两处：\n\n面板顶部附近的**震动方案**下拉菜单。震动方案决定了每个脉冲驱动哪个马达，切换方案可以解决某些手柄仅支持单马达驱动的问题。\n\n**手柄校准**页面。实体马达需要一定的最低功率才能克服阻力起动旋转（即启转阈值）。如果微弱的提示完全消失，请使用该页面中的**渐变测试**工具校准马达的启转阈值并平衡各马达的强度。",
