 ["Create"] = "创建",
 ["Create a new editable custom profile that starts as an exact copy of %s."] = "创建一个新的可编辑自定义配置文件，初始内容为 %s 的完整副本。",
 ["Create a new profile from Registry.lua's stock defaults and switch to it."] = "基于 Registry.lua 的内置默认值创建新配置文件并切换至该文件。",
 ["Create a new profile that starts as an exact copy of the one in use, and switch to it. The two are independent from the first edit."] = "创建一个以当前使用配置为完全副本的新配置文件并切换至该文件。从初次编辑起两者即完全独立。",
 ["Create editable copy"] = "创建可编辑副本",
 ["Create..."] = "创建...",
 ["Crest froth & spray"] = "浪头泡沫与飞沫",
 ["Crisp high-frequency motor vibration applied right as the wave crest reaches peak amplitude. Fades out smoothly when submerged."] = "当波峰达到最大振幅的瞬间施加清脆的高频马达震动。潜入水中时平滑淡出。",
 ["Cue index"] = "提示索引",
 ["Curated starting setups balanced for specific roles and playstyles. Unlike an empty configuration, each profile prioritizes the tactile signals most critical to that activity while filtering out background noise.\n\n|cffffd100Dungeons & Raids|r prioritize high signal-to-noise: threat loss, defensive mitigations, interrupt windows, and spell completion ticks take precedence.\n|cffffd100World Immersion|r profiles emphasize atmospheric game-feel: footstep weight by armor type, mount strides, swimming resistance, weather changes, and exploration.\n|cffffd100PvP|r provides pure tactical radar with zero ambient distraction.\n\nTip: Click |cffffd100Set for Spec|r to bind any profile to your active talent specialization, or customize auto-switch rules on the |cffffd100Profiles|r page."] = "针对特定职责和游戏风格精心调校的初始配置。与空白配置不同，每个配置文件都优先强化对该场景最关键的触觉信号，同时过滤背景杂音。\n\n|cffffd100地下城与团队副本|r优先保证高信噪比：仇恨丢失、防御减伤、打断时机以及施法完成提示震动享有最高优先级。\n|cffffd100大世界沉浸|r配置文件侧重环境游戏体感：不同护甲类型的脚步重量感、坐骑步伐、游泳阻力、天气变化以及探索互动。\n|cffffd100PvP|r提供纯粹的战术雷达感知，杜绝环境干扰。\n\n提示：点击|cffffd100按专精设定|r可将任意配置文件绑定至当前激活的天赋专精，或在|cffffd100配置文件|r页面自定义自动切换规则。",
 ["Cycles per second, if you turn the swell on below. 0.15 is roughly one slow rise and fall every seven seconds. Deliberately far slower than the stroke rate above — two layers sharing a frequency read as one sensation instead of two."] = "若在下方开启涌浪，此项设定每秒周期数。0.15 约等于每 7 秒一次缓慢的起伏升降。刻意设定为远慢于上方的划水频率——若两层触感共享相同频率，会被感知为一个整体而非两个独立的层次。",
