 ["Delete"] = "删除",
 ["Delete profile \"%s\"? This can't be undone."] = "确定删除配置文件“%s”？此操作无法撤销。",
 ["Delete the profile in use. Every rule naming it is cleared, so those scopes fall through to the next one down. Built-in profiles can't be deleted."] = "删除当前使用的配置文件。所有引用该配置文件的规则都将被清除，相应作用域将回退至下一级配置。内置预设配置文件无法删除。",
 ["Delete this profile"] = "删除此配置文件",
 ["Delete..."] = "删除...",
 ["Detect"] = "检测",
 ["Detected via the global cooldown (spell 61304 ticking), not a per-ability read — so it only fires for abilities that trigger the GCD, and fires once per GCD even if what you pressed doesn't share a name with it. Off by default — this is the one idea in the whole catalogue that genuinely competes for channel time during a pull. Try it, but it's not for everyone."] = "通过公共冷却时间（GCD，法术61304脉冲）检测，而非读取特定技能——因此仅在使用触发GCD的技能时触发，且每个GCD只触发一次，即使按下的技能与其不同名也是如此。默认关闭——这是整个目录中唯一会在开怪战斗期间明显占用震动通道的设计。可以尝试一下，但并不适合所有人。",
 ["Device"] = "设备",
 ["Directory of all %d vibration cues in Pulse, in alphabetical order. Click any entry to jump directly to its controls."] = "Pulse 中全部 %d 个震动提示的索引目录，按字母顺序排列。点击任意条目可直接跳转至其控制选项。",
 ["Disable All"] = "全部禁用",
 ["Disable all cues"] = "禁用所有提示",
 ["Disable all cues in profile"] = "禁用配置文件中的所有提示",
 ["Disable every vibration cue in the active profile in one sweep for quiet testing or building a profile from scratch."] = "一键禁用当前配置文件中的每个震动提示，用于静音测试或从零开始构建配置文件。",
 ["Disabled"] = "已禁用",
 ["Disarmed"] = "被缴械",
 ["Discordant combat spam"] = "杂乱的战斗干扰信息",
 ["Dismounted"] = "下马",
 ["Displays a shortcut button on the edge of your minimap for quick access to settings and toggling vibration."] = "在小地图边缘显示快捷按钮，以便快速打开设置和切换震动开关。",
 ["Distinct from this addon's own \"Gold looted\"/\"Item obtained\" (World category) — this is Tremor's original item-award cue, kept alongside rather than merged, since the underlying events differ."] = "与本插件自身的“拾取金币”/“获得物品”（属于“世界”分类）不同——这是 Tremor 原版的物品奖励提示，由于底层事件不同，因此予以保留并存而非合并。",
 ["Distinctiveness"] = "辨识度",
 ["Distinguished from cancelling by Blizzard's own `isCancelled` flag, which it sets before ending the selection — so a cancel never counts as a choice."] = "通过暴雪自带的 `isCancelled` 标记与取消操作区分开来，该标记在结束选择前设置——因此取消绝不会被计为确认选择。",
 ["Distinguished from craftStopped by whether the cast actually succeeded, which Core/CastActivity.lua tracks across the cast lifecycle rather than guessing from one event. Untested."] = "通过施法是否真正成功来与 craftStopped 区分，Core/CastActivity.lua 在整个施法生命周期中全程追踪，而非仅凭单个事件推断。未测试。",
 ["Does nothing on a specialisation with no secondary resource. Expect it to fire often on a class that refills constantly, such as a rogue rebuilding combo points. Not a duplicate of this addon's own \"Combo point gained\" above — that ticks per point, this fires once on reaching the cap for any of the seven candidate resources."] = "对没有次要资源的专精无任何效果。在资源频繁回满的职业（例如潜行者积攒连击点）上会频繁触发。与本插件上方自带的“获得连击点”提示并不重复——后者每获得一点就会震动，而本提示则在7种候选资源中的任意一种达到上限时触发一次。",
 ["Doubles as the catch-all: a loss-of-control type this addon does not recognise — a new one added by a patch — fires this generic cue instead of being silently dropped."] = "兼作通用兜底处理：若插件无法识别某种失控类型（例如补丁新增的类型），将触发此通用提示，而非被静默忽略。",
 ["Dragonriding / Skyriding thrust"] = "驭龙术 / 天空飞跃推力",
 ["Drive this motor at half power for a second and a half, bypassing every setting on this page and every schema. If you feel nothing here, this channel does not work on your controller and no amount of tuning below will change that."] = "以半数功率驱动该马达1.5秒，绕过本页面的所有设置与所有震动方案。若此处感受不到任何震动，说明你的手柄不支持该通道，下方的任何调校都无法改变这一点。",
 ["Drowning damage"] = "溺水伤害",
 ["Drowning heartbeat interval"] = "溺水心跳间隔",
 ["Drowning panic peak"] = "溺水恐慌峰值",
 ["Druid"] = "德鲁伊",
 ["Dual asymmetrical ERM motors, balanced 75ms spin-up"] = "双非对称 ERM 马达，平衡 75 毫秒起转",
 ["Dual-motor rumble & vibration schemas"] = "双马达震动方案",
 ["DualSense (PS5)"] = "DualSense (PS5)",
 ["DualShock 4 (PS4)"] = "DualShock 4 (PS4)",
 ["Duel request"] = "决斗请求",
 ["Dungeon queue popped"] = "地下城排队就绪",
 ["Dungeon: Caster"] = "地下城：法系",
 ["Dungeon: Caster DPS"] = "地下城：法系输出",
 ["Dungeon: Healer"] = "地下城：治疗",
 ["Dungeon: Hunter"] = "地下城：猎人",
 ["Dungeon: Melee"] = "地下城：近战",
 ["Dungeon: Melee DPS"] = "地下城：近战输出",
 ["Dungeon: Tank"] = "地下城：坦克",
 ["Dungeons & Raids"] = "地下城与团队副本",
 ["Duration"] = "持续时间",
 ["Duration of the software overdrive kick. 0.030s on heavy ERM counterweights, 0.0 on LRAs."] = "软件过载激励脉冲的持续时间。重型 ERM 转子马达建议为 0.030 秒，LRA 线性马达建议为 0.0。",
 ["Effort only, routed by default to the heavy motor alongside \"In water\", so the two merge into natural fluid resistance with clean glide coast-down between strokes. Turn on \"Own motor\" only if you want the stroke isolated on the high-frequency motor. Scales on your speed relative to your own swim speed, so it is silent while floating."] = "仅划水做功，默认与“水中浮力”一同路由至重震马达，使二者融合成自然的流体阻力，并在每次划水之间伴随清爽的滑行减速感。仅当你希望将划水感隔离至轻震马达时，才开启“独立马达”。根据相对于自身游泳速度的移速缩放，因此静止漂浮时保持静音。",
 ["Effort peak"] = "发力峰值",
 ["Empowered cast stage"] = "蓄力施法阶段",
 ["Enable All"] = "全部启用",
 ["Enable Continuous Immersion Haptics (Master)"] = "启用沉浸式持续触觉反馈（总开关）",
 ["Enable Cue"] = "启用提示",
 ["Enable Pulse"] = "启用 Pulse",
 ["Enable all cues"] = "启用所有提示",
 ["Enable all cues in profile"] = "启用配置文件中的所有提示",
 ["Enable every vibration cue in the active profile in one sweep for testing and debugging."] = "一键启用当前配置文件中的每个震动提示，用于测试与调试。",
 ["Enabled"] = "已启用",
 ["Enchanting"] = "附魔",
 ["Encounter"] = "首领战斗",
 ["Engine defaults without device-specific calibration"] = "引擎默认值（未进行特定设备校准）",
 ["Engineering"] = "工程学",
 ["Entered a vehicle"] = "进入载具",
 ["Entered melee range"] = "进入近战范围",
 ["Entering combat"] = "进入战斗",
 ["Environment"] = "环境",
 ["Equipment"] = "装备",
 ["Estimator only, and ignored while the real event is in use. Recalculates the predicted next swing when you parry an incoming attack (real formula: reduces remaining time by 40% of weapon speed, floored at 20%)."] = "仅为估算值，在真实事件启用时将被忽略。当你招架一次近战攻击时，重新计算预期的下一次攻击动作（实际公式：将剩余时间缩短 40% of 武器速度，下限为 20%）。",
 ["Every character"] = "所有角色",
 ["Every cue, its intensity and \"feels like\" shape, your profiles, per-mode motor and timing tuning, controller calibration, the mode tester and the guide — all of it is in Pulse's own window.\n\nIt draws itself rather than living as pages in this panel, which is what lets it build only what you are looking at instead of every control in the addon at every login."] = "每个提示、其强度与“体感”形态、你的配置文件、各模式马达与时间节奏微调、手柄校准、模式测试器与指南——全部都在 Pulse 的独立窗口中。\n\n该界面完全自主绘制，而非作为本面板内的分页存在，这让它仅在你查看时动态构建所需内容，避免每次登录时预载插件的每一个控件。",
 ["Everything under the Accessibility headings is imported from Tremor, this addon's sibling — the same events, the same triggers, built for telling you about things you'd otherwise have to see, like a stun landing or your cast breaking.\n\nOne thing did not carry over: Tremor plays one cue at a time and makes the most urgent one win, on the reasoning that a late or blended signal is worse than none. Pulse doesn't work that way — everything here can layer together, which is what makes the movement and combat textures feel good, but it means an accessibility cue can arrive blended with something else rather than standing alone the way it would in Tremor.\n\nIf precise, unambiguous accessibility signals matter more to you than game-feel texture, Tremor on its own is built specifically for that and doesn't have this tradeoff. The two are not meant to run at the same time."] = "“辅助功能”标题下的所有内容均源自本插件的姐妹插件 Tremor——采用相同的事件、相同的触发器，旨在提示那些你原本必须依靠视觉才能察觉的事情，例如受到昏迷或施法被打断。\n\n唯有一点没有沿用：Tremor 一次只播放一个提示并以最高优先级的信号为准，理由是延迟或混合的信号比没有信号更糟。Pulse 的运作方式并非如此——此处的所有震动都可以叠加融合，这正是让移动和战斗材质震动体感出色的原因，但也意味着辅助功能提示可能会与其他效果混合传达，而无法像在 Tremor 中那样独立呈现。\n\n如果你觉得精准无歧义的辅助功能信号比游戏触感材质更重要，Tremor 本身就是为此专门打造的，不存在这种权衡。两者不应同时运行。",
 ["Evoker-only in practice. It stays registered for every class and simply never fires for the others."] = "实际上仅适用于唤魔师。它对所有职业保持注册状态，但对其他职业绝不触发。",
 ["Excessive combat telegraph alarms"] = "过度的战斗技能预警提示",
 ["Experience gained"] = "获得经验值",
 ["Experimental"] = "实验性",
 ["Experimental (game-feel)"] = "实验性（游戏手感）",
 ["Experimental. Listens for the client spellcast event of Windfury Attack (Spell ID 25504). Dependent on the server emitting UNIT_SPELLCAST_SUCCEEDED for item proc extra attacks."] = "实验性功能。监听风怒攻击（法术ID 25504）的客户端施法事件。依赖于服务器为物品触发的额外攻击发送UNIT_SPELLCAST_SUCCEEDED。",
 ["Experimental. Measures the interval between consecutive main-hand swings. Extra attacks arrive well under 50% of weapon speed without needing combat log access. Confirmed working on WoW Forever."] = "实验性功能。测量主手连续挥动之间的时间间隔。无需访问战斗日志，额外攻击的到达间隔远低于 50% of 武器速度。已确认在 WoW Forever 上正常运作。",
 ["Experimental: watches whichever spells the Cooldown Manager's Essential category shows, not a hardcoded list. The exact live \"just became ready\" signal was never independently confirmed before this shipped — built on the same C_Spell.GetSpellCooldown transition-tracking this file already uses for the GCD heartbeat."] = "实验性功能：监控冷却管理器“核心”类别中显示的法术，而非硬编码列表。发布前尚未独立实测验证准确的实机“刚准备就绪”信号——基于本文件已用于GCD心跳检测的相同C_Spell.GetSpellCooldown状态转换追踪构建。",
 ["Fast attack time constant used specifically for discrete impacts, clicks, and strikes. Gives snappy transients without making sustained immersion textures harsh."] = "专用于离散撞击、点击与打击的快速起振时间常数。提供干脆利落的瞬态响应，同时避免持续沉浸材质震感变得生硬刺手。",
