 ["Feel %s"] = "感受 %s",
 ["Feel Strength"] = "体感强度",
 ["Feel crafting"] = "感知制造",
 ["Feel this texture"] = "体验此震感",
 ["Feels like"] = "体感效果",
 ["Feels like: "] = "体感效果：",
 ["Feels like: %s"] = "感觉类似：%s",
 ["Find breakaway floor"] = "查找启转阈值",
 ["Fires as an empowered cast of yours begins and ends."] = "在你的蓄力施法开始和结束时触发。",
 ["Fires at most "] = "最多触发 ",
 ["Fires at most %s."] = "最多触发 %s。",
 ["Fires for a craft that stopped without succeeding — moving, being interrupted, or cancelling. Untested."] = "当制造未成功即停止时触发——移动、被打断或手动取消。未经测试。",
 ["Fires for any summon confirmation dialog, not only a player summoning you."] = "在出现任何召唤确认对话框时触发，不仅限于其他玩家召唤你。",
 ["Fires for every interaction window, including the ones with their own opening cue. Untested."] = "在打开任何交互窗口时触发，包括那些拥有专属打开提示的窗口。未测试。",
 ["Fires from GUILDBANKFRAME_OPENED or from the interaction manager's GuildBanker type, whichever this client sends. Untested."] = "由 GUILDBANKFRAME_OPENED 或交互管理器的 GuildBanker 类型触发，取决于当前客户端发送哪个事件。未测试。",
 ["Fires on BAG_OVERFLOW_WITH_FULL_INVENTORY, UI_ERROR_MESSAGE (inventory full error) and when free bag slots drop to zero."] = "当触发 BAG_OVERFLOW_WITH_FULL_INVENTORY、UI_ERROR_MESSAGE（背包已满错误）以及可用背包格子降为零时触发。",
 ["Fires on BAG_UPDATE_DELAYED when total free bag slots decrease. Complements Item obtained (which tracks ITEM_PUSH fly-in loot animations)."] = "当可用背包空格总数减少时于 BAG_UPDATE_DELAYED 触发。作为“获得物品”（追踪 ITEM_PUSH 飞入背包拾取动画）的补充。",
 ["Fires on BAG_UPDATE_DELAYED when total free bag slots increase while not interacting with a merchant, bank, or mail."] = "当未与商人、银行或邮件交互期间可用背包空格总数增加时，于 BAG_UPDATE_DELAYED 触发。",
 ["Fires on BANKFRAME_CLOSED, GUILDBANKFRAME_CLOSED, or interaction manager banker hide."] = "在 BANKFRAME_CLOSED、GUILDBANKFRAME_CLOSED 或交互管理器银行职员隐藏时触发。",
 ["Fires on LOOT_READY when gathering loot is ready."] = "当采集拾取准备就绪时于 LOOT_READY 触发。",
 ["Fires on PLAYER_TARGET_DIED."] = "在收到 PLAYER_TARGET_DIED 事件时触发。",
 ["Fires on SPELL_ACTIVATION_OVERLAY_GLOW_SHOW for procs such as Clearcasting, Nightfall, Overpower, Revenge, Riposte, or Art of War."] = "当触发SPELL_ACTIVATION_OVERLAY_GLOW_SHOW时针对特效触发，例如节能施法、暮光、压制、复仇、反击或战争艺术。",
 ["Fires on input, so it also fires for casts that then fail. That is intentional: this is an input-acknowledgement cue, not a success cue."] = "在按键输入时触发，因此对于随后失败的施法也会触发。这是有意设计的：本提示为按键确认提示，而非成功提示。",
 ["Fires on money changes with an open bank frame or guild bank money update."] = "当银行面板处于打开状态下金钱发生变动，或公会银行金币更新时触发。",
 ["Fires on taxi takeoff when control is lost to the flight master mount."] = "当控制权交由飞行管理员坐骑并起飞时触发。",
 ["Fires on the change itself, not on every flag update."] = "仅在状态本身发生改变时触发，而非在每次标记刷新时触发。",
 ["Fires on the crossing into low, not repeatedly while low."] = "仅在耐久度跌入过低区间时触发一次，而非在低耐久状态下重复触发。",
 ["Fires on the yellow informational messages the game shows in the top centre of the screen."] = "在屏幕顶部中央显示黄色游戏提示信息时触发。",
 ["Fires once when the controller's battery drops into its low or critical range."] = "当手柄电量降至偏低或严重不足时触发一次。",
 ["Fires only when a queue enters the ready-to-enter state, not on every status update."] = "仅在排队进入“可进入”状态时触发，而非在每次状态更新时触发。",
 ["Fires specifically when a channelled spell of yours is cut short by an interrupt, not when it simply ends."] = "专用于你的引导法术被外部打断中断时触发，而非自然结束。",
 ["Fires the instant you press a cast, before the server has confirmed it."] = "在你按下施法瞬间触发，无需等待服务器确认。",
 ["Fires upon arrival at destination when player control is restored."] = "在到达目的地且玩家角色控制权恢复时触发。",
 ["Fires when a battleground or arena queue is ready to enter."] = "战场或竞技场排队准备就绪可进入时触发。",
 ["Fires when a boss encounter begins."] = "首领战开始时触发。",
 ["Fires when a boss encounter ends, in victory or in a wipe."] = "首领战结束时触发（无论是获胜还是团灭）。",
 ["Fires when a channelled spell of yours ends, whether it ran to completion or was cut short."] = "当你的引导法术结束时触发，无论其完整引导完毕还是中途被打断。",
 ["Fires when a class or profession trainer's window opens."] = "当职业或专业训练师窗口打开时触发。",
