 ["Fires when one of your own casts ends, whether or not it completed."] = "你自身的施法结束时触发（无论是否成功完成）。",
 ["Fires when one of your own casts is interrupted or cancelled before completion."] = "当你自己的施法在完成前被打断或取消时触发。",
