 ["Heavy left counterweight (85ms), light right counterweight (45ms)"] = "左侧重配重块 (85毫秒)，右侧轻配重块 (45毫秒)",
 ["Herbalism"] = "草药学",
 ["High Motor Only"] = "仅轻震马达",
 ["High motor"] = "轻震马达",
 ["High motor (sharp rumble)"] = "轻震马达（高频震动）",
 ["High-clarity encounter triage. Critical raid mechanics, debuffs, boss abilities, and personal survival alerts with world clutter silenced."] = "高清晰度的首领战信息分流。关键团队副本机制、减益效果、首领技能与个人生存预警，同时静音大世界冗余震动。",
 ["High-motor ceiling at full gliding speed. Only audible while actually gliding."] = "全速滑翔时轻震马达的强度上限。仅在实际滑翔时方可感知。",
 ["High-tempo physical execution. Snappy combo points and resource spenders, execute range alerts, boss telegraphs, and kick windows."] = "快节奏的物理打击感。清脆利落的连击点数与资源消耗反馈、斩杀血线预警、首领技能预警与打断时机。",
 ["Hit with a critical strike"] = "受到爆击",
 ["Honor gained"] = "获得荣誉",
 ["Hooks Blizzard's shared tab plumbing (TabSystemMixin:SetTab, TabSystemOwnerMixin:SetTab, PanelTemplates_SetTab). Filtered on those functions' own `isUserAction` argument where they provide one, so a panel setting its own tab as it opens stays silent and only a tab YOU changed fires. Two known gaps: PanelTemplates_SetTab is the legacy path and has no such flag, so a few older panels may still fire on open; and the two mixin hooks only reach panels created AFTER Pulse loads, because Mixin() copies function references onto a frame at creation. Most big tabbed panels are load-on-demand and so are covered, but anything built before this addon isn't. Expect this one to be patchy."] = "Hook 暴雪通用的标签页底层接口（TabSystemMixin:SetTab、TabSystemOwnerMixin:SetTab、PanelTemplates_SetTab）。在接口提供 `isUserAction` 参数时进行过滤，从而让面板打开时自动选中的标签页保持静音，仅当【你】主动切换标签页时触发。存在两处已知盲区：PanelTemplates_SetTab 属于旧版接口且缺少此标记，因此少数老旧面板打开时仍可能触发；此外这两个 Mixin 的 Hook 仅对 Pulse 加载【之后】创建的面板有效，因为 Mixin() 在框体创建时会直接复制函数引用。大多数大型多标签面板均为按需加载因此已被覆盖，但在本插件加载前创建的界面则无法生效。该功能在部分界面中的表现可能不够完整。",
 ["Hooks StackSplitFrame:UpdateStackText."] = "挂钩 StackSplitFrame:UpdateStackText。",
 ["Hostile target under reticle"] = "准星下的敌方目标",
 ["How far a motor has to move before the addon bothers telling the client about it. Raise it to cut the number of calls; too high and slow fades turn into visible steps. Shared by every channel — this is a call-rate setting, not a motor property."] = "马达强度需要发生多大变化，插件才会向客户端回报。调高此值可减少调用次数；若调得过高，平缓淡出可能会变成肉眼可察觉的阶梯式顿挫。所有通道共享此项——这是调用频率设定，而非马达硬件属性。",
 ["How far the hum swells either side of its baseline. 0 is a flat hold."] = "嗡鸣声围绕基线起伏膨胀的幅度。0 表示平稳维持。",
 ["How fast the wingbeat-style undulation cycles."] = "振翅式起伏波动的循环速率。",
 ["How long this motor takes to fall back toward silence. Too high and consecutive taps blur into one buzz; too low and sustained textures sound chopped. 0.028 reproduces the engine's old behaviour at 60fps."] = "该马达衰减回静音所需的时间。数值过高会导致连续轻击粘连成一片蜂鸣；数值过低会导致持续纹理听起来断断续续。0.028 可在 60fps 下复现引擎此前的行为特性。",
 ["How long this motor takes to reach a new, stronger level during continuous textures. Higher is softer and more gradual; lower is snappier. 0.075 reproduces the engine's old behaviour at 60fps."] = "在持续震动材质播放期间，该马达过渡至更高震动强度所需的时间。数值越高越柔和渐进；数值越低越干脆迅速。0.075 可重现引擎在 60fps 下的旧版行为。",
 ["How many seconds before the scripted moment this fires."] = "在脚本时刻到来前多少秒触发。",
 ["How often the hum swells, in cycles per second. 0.30 is roughly one slow breath every three seconds."] = "蜂鸣起伏膨胀的频率（以每秒周期数计）。0.30 约等于每三秒一次缓慢的呼吸起伏。",
 ["How often the lub-dub repeats while the warning stays active. Higher is more urgent; lower is less annoying. Independent of the screen flash's own (fixed, ~57 BPM) rate — this is a separate timer, not synced to it."] = "警告保持激活状态时，“砰-咚”心跳双重搏动的重复频率。数值越高越紧迫急促；数值越低越不显烦扰。独立于屏幕闪烁自身的固定速率（约 57 BPM）——此项为独立计时器，与其不同步。",
 ["How pronounced each stroke is against its own baseline. Higher values (0.80-1.0) allow the counterweight to physically spin down during the glide phase between strokes. 0 is a flat drag with no rhythm at all."] = "每个划行动作相对于其基线的明显程度。较高的数值（0.80-1.0）允许配重块在两次划水之间的滑行阶段自然减速。0 为完全没有节奏的单调拖拽。",
 ["How sharply the high motor ramps in with speed. 1 = linear, higher = holds back more until near max speed. Only audible while actually gliding."] = "轻震马达随速度递增的陡峭程度。1 = 线性，数值越高 = 越接近极速时才猛烈介入。仅在实际滑翔时可感知。",
 ["How steady the low motor stays regardless of speed. Only audible while actually gliding."] = "无论速度如何，重震马达保持平稳的程度。仅在实际滑翔时可被感知。",
 ["How strong the hum gets by the moment a regular cast completes. Only audible if \"Casting texture\" is also enabled on its own tab."] = "常规施法完成瞬间嗡鸣达到的强度。仅在对应标签页中同样启用了“施法材质震动”时方可感知。",
 ["How strong the stealth hum is overall. Meant to sit just at the edge of perception — if you notice it as a vibration rather than a presence, it is too high."] = "潜行嗡鸣震动的整体强度。设计初衷是刚好处于感知的临界点——如果你明显感觉它是一阵震动而非某种存在感，说明强度过高了。",
 ["Hunter"] = "猎人",
 ["Hydrodynamic water drag that scales as you swim forward through rivers and seas."] = "在江河与大海中向前游泳时，随速度变化的流体水动力阻力。",
 ["INPUT_DEVICE_INTERFACE_TRANSITION, carrying newMode/oldMode. This event is FOREVER-ONLY — it was not found anywhere in the retail Midnight archive used for comparison, so don't expect this cue to do anything on retail. Fires on any transition in either direction; the payload would let it be split into separate entered/left cues later if that's worth having."] = "INPUT_DEVICE_INTERFACE_TRANSITION，携带 newMode/oldMode 参数。该事件【仅限 WoW Forever】——在用于对比的正式服 Midnight 存档中未发现此事件，因此不要期望该提示在正式服中生效。在任何方向的输入模式切换时均会触发；其数据载荷可在未来有需要时进一步拆分为独立的“进入/退出”提示。",
