 ["In water"] = "水中",
 ["Initial software voltage boost applied during transient onset to accelerate the motor rapidly to target speed. 1.0 is disabled."] = "在瞬态开始时应用的初始软件电压增强，以使马达迅速加速至目标转速。1.0 为禁用。",
