 ["Instant ability used"] = "已使用瞬发技能",
 ["Instants and completed casts arrive on the same event, so \"Cast succeeded\" has always fired for both. Core/CastActivity.lua tells them apart by whether a START was seen first; this is the instant half. Leave \"Cast succeeded\" off if you want only one of the two. Untested."] = "瞬发技能与读条完成共用同一个事件，因此“施法成功”以往对两者都会触发。Core/CastActivity.lua 通过先前是否检测到 START 事件来区分它们；本项专属于瞬发法术。若你只想要其中一种反馈，请关闭“施法成功”。未经测试。",
