 ["Launch the interactive onboarding wizard to configure controller hardware, combat haptics, world feedback, and immersion textures."] = "启动交互式入门向导，配置手柄硬件、战斗触觉、世界环境反馈与沉浸震动材质。",
 ["Layers with \"Underwater breath texture\" when breath runs out. Fires on suffocation damage while submerged."] = "呼吸耗尽时与“水下呼吸纹理”叠加生效。在潜水受到窒息伤害时触发。",
