 ["Low Motor Only"] = "仅重震马达",
 ["Low health"] = "低生命值",
 ["Low health alarms, heal cast success, self/enemy interrupt warnings, dispellable CC"] = "低生命值警报、治疗施法成功、自身/敌方打断预警、可驱散控制",
 ["Low health texture"] = "低生命值材质震动",
 ["Low motor"] = "重震马达",
 ["Low motor (heavy rumble)"] = "重震马达（低频震动）",
 ["Low motor holds a steady presence, floored so it's never silent while gliding; high motor eases in from near-silent toward thrillPeak as speed climbs, shaped by thrillCurve."] = "重震马达保持持续存在感，设有最低阈值使其在滑翔时永不沉寂；轻震马达则随着速度提升从近乎无声平稳过渡至 thrillPeak，受 thrillCurve 曲线调制。",
 ["Low on breath"] = "呼吸不足",
 ["Low, irregular micro-pulses — rain, patter."] = "低沉、不规则的微脉冲——雨丝、雨滴敲打。",
 ["MEASURED as of 2026-09-21, not estimated. Driven by Forever's PLAYER_SWING event, which carries swingDuration and a MainHand/OffHand/Ranged type, both confirmed non-secret, and which Blizzard's own swing timer consumes. Note this is a SWING, not necessarily a connection — whether it also fires on a miss, dodge or parry is untested, and a \"successful hit\" cue would need a different source. The old weapon-speed estimator is kept as a fallback and engages automatically if the event ever disappears; it predicted swing times from UnitAttackSpeed with a haste cache, range and stun gating and a parry-haste correction, and drifted with nothing to correct against."] = "截至2026-09-21已改为【实测】而非估算。由Forever版本的PLAYER_SWING事件驱动，该事件包含swingDuration以及MainHand/OffHand/Ranged类型，两者均确认为非私密数据，且暴雪自家的挥动计时器也是读取该事件。请注意这是【挥动】，不一定代表命中——未命中、闪躲或招架时是否也会触发尚未经测试，而“成功命中”提示需要不同的数据源。旧版武器速度估算器被保留作为后备方案，若该事件失效则会自动接管；旧版基于UnitAttackSpeed结合急速缓存、距离与昏迷判定门控以及招架加速修正来预估挥动时间，由于缺乏校准基准会逐渐产生漂移。",
 ["MUTED"] = "已静音",
 ["Mage"] = "法师",
 ["Mailbox opened"] = "邮箱已打开",
 ["Manage"] = "管理",
 ["Mark floor from ramp"] = "从渐变测试标记启转阈值",
 ["Master Vibration Strength"] = "主震动强度",
 ["Master switch for all menu, window, tab, and radial controller haptics. Turn off to silence all UI navigation haptics at once while keeping combat and world rumble active."] = "所有菜单、窗口、标签页和轮盘手柄触觉的总开关。关闭此项可一次性静音所有界面导航震动，同时保留战斗与世界环境震动。",
 ["Master switch for every loss-of-control cue below. With this off, none of them fire and no loss-of-control events are registered at all."] = "下方所有失去控制提示的总开关。关闭后，所有提示均不会触发，且完全不会注册任何失去控制事件。",
 ["Master switch. With this off, nothing registers and nothing costs anything."] = "总开关。关闭后，不注册任何事件且无任何性能开销。",
 ["Melee auto-attack started"] = "近战自动攻击开始",
 ["Melee auto-attack stopped"] = "近战自动攻击停止",
 ["Menu & controller UI haptics"] = "菜单与手柄界面触觉",
 ["Menus & tabs"] = "菜单与标签页",
 ["Messages"] = "消息",
 ["Mid breath threshold"] = "中期呼吸阈值",
 ["Minimum severity"] = "最低严重度",
 ["Mining"] = "采矿",
 ["Mirrors critLanded's split exactly: HEAL_CRIT on the same personal COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE feed. critLanded's incoming-vs-outgoing direction was independently confirmed live (2026-09-15) for damage; the same direction for heals is inferred by analogy (same feed, same self-scoped design), not separately re-tested — worth confirming live before trusting it's \"you were healed\" rather than \"you landed a heal\" if that distinction matters to you."] = "完全对应critLanded的逻辑划分：在相同的个人COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE数据流中监听HEAL_CRIT。critLanded对于伤害是“承受还是造成”的方向已在实机中独立证实（2026-09-15）；治疗的方向通过类比推断（相同的数据流，相同的自身作用域设计），未作单独复测——如果对你来说“受到治疗”与“造成治疗”的区别至关重要，建议在实机中先行验证。",
 ["Mode to test"] = "待测试模式",
 ["Most specific wins. A scope set to |cffffd100No rule|r has no opinion and lets the one below it decide; with none of them set, Pulse uses Default."] = "最具体的规则优先。若作用域设为|cffffd100无规则|r，则不作设定并由其下级规则决定；若均未设置，Pulse 将使用默认配置。",
 ["Most triggers are a **pulse** — something happens, you feel one short burst, then it's gone.\n\nSome are a **texture** instead — a faint, continuous feeling for as long as something is true. Swimming, gliding, casting, riding a flight path, weathering a storm: these fade in in the moment they start and fade out the instant they stop, rather than announcing themselves once. They're built to layer underneath pulses rather than compete with them — a critical hit still lands as a distinct thump even while a casting texture is quietly running underneath it.\n\nMost textures ship switched off, on purpose: a constant hum is a bigger ask than an occasional pulse, and it's worth trying deliberately rather than discovering by accident."] = "大多数触发器都是**脉冲**——某个事件发生，你感受到一次短促的震动，随后消失。\n\n部分触发器则是**材质纹理**——只要某种状态持续存在，就会伴随一种微弱而连续的感觉。游泳、滑翔、施法、乘坐飞行路线坐骑、经历暴风雨：它们在开始瞬间淡入并在结束瞬间淡出，而不是仅通报一次。它们被设计为垫在脉冲底层，而不是与之冲突——即使施法材质震动在底层悄然运行，爆击命中依然会以明确扎实的重击呈现。\n\n大多数材质震动默认特意处于关闭状态：持续的嗡鸣相比偶尔的脉冲对感官负担更大，值得你主动去尝试开启，而不是意外发现。",
 ["Motor & Timing"] = "马达与时间节奏",
 ["Mount weight"] = "坐骑重量感",
 ["Mounted up"] = "上马",
 ["Mounts & travel"] = "坐骑与旅行",
 ["Movement"] = "移动",
 ["Movement & Travel"] = "移动与旅行",
 ["Multiplies %s's high-motor intensity. 1.0 is the authored default; the top of this slider is where it stops making any further difference."] = "乘以 %s 的轻震马达强度。1.0 为设计默认值；滑块拉到最顶端即为不再产生进一步差异的上限。",
 ["Multiplies %s's low-motor intensity. 1.0 is the authored default; the top of this slider is where it stops making any further difference."] = "乘以 %s 的重震马达强度。1.0 为设计默认值；滑块拉到最顶端即为不再产生进一步差异的上限。",
 ["Multiplies every impact, on top of each profession's own weight. Set it to zero for a craft you feel but never get hit by."] = "在各专业自身权重的基础上，成倍调节每次敲击的力度。若希望制造时仅有触感而无剧烈敲击感，可将其设为零。",
 ["Multiplies every impact, on top of each profession's own weight. Set to zero for a craft you feel but never get hit by."] = "在各专业自身权重的基础上，成倍调节每次敲击的力度。若希望制造时仅有触感而无剧烈敲击感，可设为零。",
 ["Multiplies every trigger's intensity. Part of the current profile, not global."] = "按倍率缩放每个触发器的强度。属于当前配置文件，非全局设定。",
 ["Multiplies gait strength while mounted, on top of the racial mount's own weight. A kodo is already heavier than a hawkstrider before this touches it."] = "在种族坐骑自身重量的基础上，倍增骑乘时的步态强度。在此参数生效前，科多兽的体感本就比陆行鸟更沉重。",
 ["Multiplies the baseline while fully submerged rather than bobbing at the surface, via IsSubmerged(). Set to 1.0 to feel the same either way. UNVERIFIED: IsSubmerged is confirmed present in the client API list, but whether it really distinguishes the two cases here has not been checked live."] = "通过 IsSubmerged()，在完全潜入水中而非在水面浮沉时按倍率调节基础震感。设为 1.0 使两者震感一致。未经实测：客户端 API 列表中已确认存在 IsSubmerged，但其实际能否准确区分这两种情况尚未进行实机验证。",
 ["Multiplies the continuous layer under every craft, on top of each profession's own weight. This is the part you feel for the whole craft rather than the individual blows."] = "在各专业自身权重的基础上，成倍调节每次制造底层的持续震感。这是在整个制造过程中持续感知的震动，而非单次的敲击感。",
 ["NPC emote nearby"] = "附近 NPC 表情动作",
 ["Name the new profile:"] = "为新配置文件命名：",
 ["Naturalistic scout feel. Locomotion, flight gliding, wilderness weather, tracking/stealth cues, world exploration, and bow release."] = "自然的斥候体感。移动、飞行滑翔、荒野天气、追踪/潜行提示、世界探索与拉弓射击释放感。",
 ["Navigation"] = "导航",
 ["Never miss an important group alert, even while looking away:\n• |cffffffffDirect Whispers:|r Distinct personal communication blip on incoming whispers.\n• |cffffffffParty & Raid Invites:|r Dual-pulse notification when receiving group invitations.\n• |cffffffffQueue Pops & Ready Checks:|r High-priority attention-grabbing pulse when instances are ready."] = "即使视线移开，也绝不错过重要的队伍提醒：\n• |cffffffff直接密语：|r收到密语时产生清晰独特的个人通讯轻触提示。\n• |cffffffff小队与团队邀请：|r收到组队邀请时产生双脉冲震动通知。\n• |cffffffff排队就绪与就位确认：|r副本就绪时产生高优先级、引人注目的警示脉冲。",
 ["New profile"] = "新建配置文件",
 ["New setups enable casting, crafting, low-health and breath effects. Other effects start off; your saved choices are kept."] = "新配置将启用施法、制造、低生命值与呼吸效果。其他效果默认关闭；你已保存的自定义选择将予以保留。",
 ["Next >"] = "下一步 >",
 ["Nintendo Switch Pro"] = "Nintendo Switch Pro",
 ["No legacy event for this one — it arrives only through the interaction manager, so it is silent if this client does not send that. Untested."] = "该事件无传统旧版事件对应——仅通过交互管理器送达，因此若当前客户端未发送该事件则保持静音。未测试。",
 ["No rule"] = "无规则",
 ["Noisy. In a raid this event fires very frequently. Kept for completeness and defaulted off."] = "较为杂乱。在团队副本中该事件触发极其频繁。为保证功能完整而保留，默认关闭。",
 ["None (full sensory richness)"] = "无（完全感官丰富度）",
 ["None (stock defaults)"] = "无（初始默认值）",
 ["Not filtered by rarity yet — fires for anything, common items included."] = "暂未按品质过滤——对任何物品均会触发，包括普通品质物品。",
 ["Note the event name: Forever uses LEARNED_SPELL_IN_SKILL_LINE, not the older LEARNED_SPELL_IN_TAB, which is absent from this client's documentation entirely. Can fire more than once for a single visit to a trainer if you buy several ranks."] = "注意事件名称：Forever版本使用的是LEARNED_SPELL_IN_SKILL_LINE，而非旧版的LEARNED_SPELL_IN_TAB，后者在当前客户端的文档中已完全不存在。如果在训练师处连续学习了多个法术等级，单次拜访可能会触发多次。",
 ["Nothing about these is percussive, so they get the bed alone. Inventing a hammer for enchanting would be inventing a sensation that is not there."] = "这些动作没有任何打击感，因此仅保留基底震颤。若为附魔强行加入锤击体感，纯属凭空捏造不存在的触觉反馈。",
 ["OFF BY DEFAULT, and that is deliberate. A rolling swell suggests ocean, and this cue fires in rivers, lakes and canals too, where it would read as wrong rather than as atmosphere — Classic has no wave physics for it to be tracking, so it would be inventing something the world is not doing. Flat presence is the honest default. Raise it if you want a swell anyway; it is a good sensation, just not a true one."] = "默认关闭，这是深思熟虑的决定。起伏的波浪涌动让人联想到大海，但该提示在河流、湖泊和运河中同样会触发，在此类场景中不仅无法烘托氛围，反而令人感到突兀——怀旧服并没有可供追踪的波浪物理引擎，因此这属于凭空臆造游戏世界并不存在的动态。平稳的基础存在感才是忠实还原的默认设定。若你无论如何都想要波浪起伏感，可自行调高；这是一种愉悦的体感，只是不够真实。",
 ["ON — option changes and cue firings will print here."] = "开启——选项变更与提示触发将在此处输出。",
 ["Occurrence only, deliberately near-subliminal so it doesn't compete with \"Levelled up\". No size scaling: the amount would need UnitXP diffing and isn't worth the bookkeeping for a cue this quiet."] = "仅单次触发事件，刻意调校为若有若无以避免与“升级”提示相冲突。无数值缩放：计算经验量需要对比 UnitXP 差异，对于如此轻微静音的提示而言不值得增加此项性能开销。",
 ["Ocean Waves & Swell"] = "海浪与海涌",
 ["Ocean waves & swell"] = "海浪与海涌",
 ["Ocean zones only (guessed from zone name)"] = "仅限海洋区域（根据区域名称推测）",
 ["Off by default and deliberately the faintest cue in the addon: this fires for EVERY NPC you talk to, which in a city is constantly. Try it before leaving it on. Untested."] = "默认关闭，且有意设计为本插件中最微弱的提示：与任何 NPC 对话时都会触发，而在城市中对话极其频繁。建议在保持开启前先体验测试。未经测试。",
 ["Off by default and mounted-only by default, on purpose: a texture that plays whenever you move is the most fatiguing thing in this addon and the most likely to make you switch it off wholesale. Uses shaped transient layers with fast-attack kicks and exponential decay to produce crisp, distinct footfalls without motor hum in between. Distinct timbres (boots, hooves, paws, heavy claws/pads, metal) drive both Low (body mass) and High (impact crispness) motors in concert. Speed is read out of combat only and held through a fight; snares and boosts are not tracked there, which is a deliberate trade for never touching a secret value. Goes quiet while swimming, flying, gliding, riding a flight path, or airborne after a jump — each of those has its own cue and footfalls have nothing to add to them."] = "默认关闭且特意默认仅在骑乘时启用：只要移动就持续播放的震动材质是本插件中最容易造成疲劳的部分，也是最可能促使你彻底关掉它的原因。采用带有快起音冲击与指数衰减的塑形瞬态层，产生清脆清晰的脚步感，其间没有马达多余的杂音嗡鸣。不同的音色材质（靴子、蹄音、爪垫、沉重的利爪/肉垫、金属）协同驱动重震（体量感）与轻震（打击清脆度）双马达。速度仅在脱战状态下读取并在战斗中保持；在此不追踪减速与加速效果，这是为了绝不触碰私密值而作出的刻意取舍。在游泳、飞行、滑翔、乘坐飞行坐骑或跳跃滞空期间保持静音——这些情况各自拥有专属提示，脚步声对其毫无增益。",
 ["Off by default — a continuous texture, not a notification."] = "默认关闭——这是一项持续震动材质，而非通知提示。",
 ["Off by default, layers with \"Low health\" rather than replacing it — same relationship as breathWarning/breathTexture. Same mechanism and same fullscreen-panel caveat as lowHealthWarning above. The shape itself is a code-level switch (Modules/Health.lua's HEARTBEAT_STYLE: smooth glow, flash-synced lub-dub, or an independently-timed lub-dub), not exposed here — flash-synced won out by feel. The knock's own gap/duration/intensity used to be four sliders here; fixed as plain constants in Modules/Health.lua once this exact combination was confirmed to feel right (2026-09-15)."] = "默认关闭，与“低生命值”叠加生效而非取而代之——类似于 breathWarning 与 breathTexture 的关系。机制与上述 lowHealthWarning 完全相同，并受相同的全屏面板限制。震动形态本身是代码级开关（Modules/Health.lua 的 HEARTBEAT_STYLE：平滑发光、闪烁同步的“怦-怦”心跳，或独立计时的“怦-怦”心跳），未在此处公开——根据体感最终采用闪烁同步方案。敲击的心跳间隔/持续时间/强度曾在此处设有四个滑块；在确认该组合体感完美后，已直接固化为 Modules/Health.lua 中的常量（2026-09-15）。",
 ["Off by default, layers with \"Low on breath\" rather than replacing it."] = "默认关闭，与“呼吸不足”叠加生效而非取而代之。",
 ["Off by default. Suppresses \"Casting texture\" for the length of a craft so the two do not layer into one lumpy sensation. The profession is read by id from the recipe (C_TradeSkillUI.GetProfessionInfoByRecipeID), so no name matching and no localisation problem — but that field is documented nilable, and anything that does not resolve falls back to a generic work rhythm rather than going quiet. Gathering is NOT covered: swinging a pick at an ore node is not a recipe and has no recipe id. Per-profession toggles and strengths are on the Crafting page. Entirely untested."] = "默认关闭。在制造期间抑制“施法材质震动”，以防两者叠合成模糊杂乱的感觉。专业技能是通过配方ID直接读取（C_TradeSkillUI.GetProfessionInfoByRecipeID），因此无需名称匹配，不存在本地化兼容问题——但该字段在文档中声明为可空（nilable），任何无法解析的情况都会回退至通用的制作节奏震动而非完全静音。采集【不包含】在内：挥镐挖掘矿脉不属于配方，也不存在配方ID。各专业的专属开关与强度可在“制造”页面中配置。完全未经测试。",
 ["Off means swings come from Forever's own PLAYER_SWING event — a real per-swing signal, confirmed non-secret and proven live. On forces the old prediction built from weapon speed instead. You should not need this: if Blizzard ever removes the event, Pulse detects that and falls back on its own. It exists so a patch that changes the event's BEHAVIOUR rather than removing it still leaves you a working cue."] = "关闭表示挥动来源于Forever版本原生的PLAYER_SWING事件——一种真实且每次挥动都触发的信号，经实机测试确认为非私密数据。开启则强制使用基于武器速度构建的旧版估算。正常情况下无需开启：如果暴雪未来移除了该事件，Pulse会自动检测并自行回退。该选项的存在是为了防范未来补丁仅改变该事件的【行为】而非直接移除时，依然能为你提供可用的提示。",
 ["Offensive"] = "进攻",
 ["Offensive Combat Haptics"] = "进攻战斗触觉",
 ["Okay"] = "确定",
 ["One cue for all four edges (top, bottom, left, right), observed via SmartNavigation's directional edge callbacks while keeping button selection isolated via polling to prevent execution taint. Standard default is off."] = "四条边缘（上、下、左、右）通用的单一提示，通过 SmartNavigation 的方向边缘回调监测，同时按钮选择通过轮询隔离以防止执行污染。标准默认设置处于关闭状态。",
 ["One cue for both directions, same reasoning as the navigation edge cue — a motor can't tell you which way you went."] = "双向共用一个提示，原因与导航边界提示相同——马达无法传达你移动的具体方向。",
 ["One full-bodied hit on both motors."] = "双马达上产生一次饱满有力的敲击。",
 ["One long, sombre pulse when a spirit healer's window opens."] = "灵魂医者窗口打开时，产生一次漫长而沉郁的脉冲。",
 ["One pattern for every kind of refusal. May also do nothing inside dungeons and raids."] = "对所有类型的拒绝行为采用同一种震动模式。在地下城和团队副本中可能不产生任何效果。",
 ["One sharp, heavy impact — fast attack, fast decay."] = "一次清脆沉重的撞击——快速起振，快速消退。",
 ["One strong, sustained pulse."] = "一次强烈而持续的脉冲。",
 ["One sustained pulse."] = "一次持续脉冲。",
 ["Only audible if \"Riding a flight path\" is also enabled on its own tab."] = "仅当其所属标签页中的“乘坐飞行路线”同时启用时方可感知。",
 ["Only while mounted"] = "仅限骑乘时",
 ["Open Pulse settings"] = "打开 Pulse 设置",
 ["Other"] = "其他",
 ["Other crafting"] = "其他制造",
 ["Overall gasp-knock strength — fixed per beat, not scaled by danger (2026-09-16: a danger-scaled lub/dub risked landing under the controller motor's own minimum activation threshold at low danger, causing missing \"dub\" knocks live). Urgency comes from heartRateCalm/heartRateCritical instead. Only audible if \"Underwater breath texture\" is also enabled on its own tab."] = "喘息敲击的整体强度——每次心跳固定，不随危险程度缩放（2026-09-16：按危险程度缩放的双心跳震动在危险较低时容易低于手柄马达的最小启转阈值，导致实机中缺失“咚”的第二声敲击）。紧迫感改由平静心率/危机心率呈现。仅在“水下呼吸材质震动”于对应标签页开启时才可感知。",
 ["Overall heave amplitude of the oceanic swell. Sets the physical displacement intensity of the slow motor."] = "海浪起伏的整体振幅。设定重震马达的物理位移强度。",
 ["Overall intensity"] = "整体强度",
 ["Overall strength of each footfall before speed and state scaling."] = "在根据移速和状态缩放之前，每次脚步踏击的整体强度。",
 ["Overall strength. Meant to sit at the edge of perception — if you notice it as a vibration rather than as being submerged, it is too high. Inherits the old idleFloatAmplitude, which was live-tuned to 0.04."] = "整体强度。旨在维持在感官察觉的边缘——若你感觉它是一阵震动而非置身水下，说明强度偏高。继承了旧版 idleFloatAmplitude，实机调校设定为 0.04。",
 ["Overdrive kick"] = "超驱冲量",
 ["Overdrive time (s)"] = "超驱时间 (秒)",
 ["Overwrite every motor's calibration with the selected controller's starting values. Ask first, because this discards any trimming you have already done."] = "使用所选手柄的预设初始值覆盖所有马达的校准。操作前会请求确认，因为这会丢弃你此前所作的任何微调。",
 ["Own motor"] = "独立马达",
 ["PLAYER_ALIVE also fires when you release to a graveyard, so this can fire while you are still a ghost."] = "释放灵魂到墓地时也会触发 PLAYER_ALIVE，因此当你仍处于幽灵状态时可能触发此提示。",
 ["PLAYER_SOFT_ENEMY_CHANGED, an occurrence-only event with no payload at all — there is nothing here to come back secret. Fires on the soft target changing, which is not the same as actually targeting something; that's still \"Target changed\" on the Target & Focus page. Expect this to fire often while sweeping the camera through a crowd."] = "PLAYER_SOFT_ENEMY_CHANGED，无任何附加参数的纯单次触发事件——此处没有任何涉密数据。在软目标发生变更时触发，这与实际选定目标不同；实际选定目标仍由“目标与焦点”页面上的“目标已变更”负责。在人群中快速转动镜头时，预计该事件会频繁触发。",
 ["PLAYER_SOFT_FRIEND_CHANGED, occurrence-only, no payload. Worth pairing with the hostile cue above only if you can tell two TICKs apart — if not, give one of them a different shape with its own \"Feels like\" dropdown."] = "PLAYER_SOFT_FRIEND_CHANGED，仅事件触发，无附加数据。只有当你能分辨两种不同的“滴答”提示震动时，才建议与上方的敌对提示搭配使用——若无法分辨，请在各自的“触感表现”下拉菜单中为其指定不同的震动形态。",
 ["PLAYER_SOFT_INTERACT_CHANGED. Unlike its two siblings this one DOES carry a payload (oldTarget/newTarget GUIDs) and is flagged SecretWhenUnitIdentityRestricted in Blizzard's own docs, so this cue deliberately reads none of it and fires on the occurrence alone. Probably the most useful of the three: it's the one that says \"there is something here\" while you're looking around."] = "PLAYER_SOFT_INTERACT_CHANGED。与另外两个同类事件不同，此事件【确实】携带数据载荷（oldTarget/newTarget 的 GUID），并且在暴雪官方文档中被标记为 SecretWhenUnitIdentityRestricted，因此本提示特意不读取任何数据，仅凭事件发生本身触发。它大概是这三者中最实用的一项：当你在四周环视时，它能提示你“这里有可交互物体”。",
 ["PLAYER_SOFT_TARGET_INTERACTION. Fires when native gamepad/action interact executes on the current soft target."] = "PLAYER_SOFT_TARGET_INTERACTION。当原生手柄/动作交互对当前软目标执行时触发。",
 ["PULSE QUICK SETUP"] = "PULSE 快速设置",
 ["Paced ranged rhythm with melee-weaving support. Auto-shot timing, weapon swings, pet status, trap triggers, and boss mechanics."] = "富有节奏的远程循环并支持近战穿插输出。自动射击时间节点、武器挥动、宠物状态、陷阱触发与首领机制。",
 ["Pacified or school-locked"] = "处于安抚或法系封锁状态",
 ["Page switches"] = "页面总开关",
 ["Paladin"] = "圣骑士",
 ["Pans left and right footfalls across the Low and High motors so the stride walks across your hands. Turn off for centered dual-motor footfalls."] = "将左右脚步踏击声像在重震与轻震马达之间平移分配，使步伐在双手掌心间交替踏过。关闭此项可获得居中的双马达同步脚步震动。",
 ["Party invite"] = "小队邀请",
 ["Party leader changed"] = "队长已变更",
 ["Passively polled by observing IsEnabled() on the currently focused element. Fires if the element becomes disabled while focused."] = "通过监测当前聚焦元素的 IsEnabled() 进行被动轮询。若聚焦元素在处于焦点状态时变为禁用则触发。",
 ["Passively polled from GamepadRadial:IsShown() to eliminate EventRegistry callback taint during radial menu activation."] = "通过被动轮询 GamepadRadial:IsShown() 实现，以消除轮盘菜单激活期间 EventRegistry 回调引起的执行污染。",
 ["Passively polled from GamepadRadial:IsShown(). Picking a segment that opens a panel also closes the radial."] = "通过被动轮询 GamepadRadial:IsShown() 实现。选择会打开界面的扇区时也会关闭轮盘。",
 ["Passively polled from SmartNavigation focus state. Fires when controller navigation gains focus on a UI element."] = "通过被动轮询 SmartNavigation 焦点状态实现。当手柄导航聚焦于界面元素时触发。",
 ["Passively polled from SmartNavigation focus state. Fires when controller navigation releases focus back to world control."] = "通过被动轮询 SmartNavigation 焦点状态实现。当手柄导航释放焦点交还世界控制权时触发。",
 ["Passively polled from SmartNavigation's currentButton every 0.05s to eliminate execution taint when gamepad mode is toggled. Fires on real focus changes rather than stick motion. Gated on gamepad UI being active."] = "每 0.05 秒被动轮询 SmartNavigation 的 currentButton，以消除切换手柄模式时的执行污染。仅在真实发生焦点变化而非摇杆晃动时触发。仅在手柄界面处于活动状态时生效。",
 ["Passively polled via GetUIPanel every 0.05s to eliminate UIParentPanelManager execution taint on protected frames."] = "每 0.05 秒通过 GetUIPanel 被动轮询，避免受保护框架产生 UIParentPanelManager 执行污染。",
 ["Passively polled via GetUIPanel every 0.05s. Detects when major UI panels are dismissed without callback taint."] = "每 0.05 秒通过 GetUIPanel 被动轮询。在不产生回调污染的前提下检测主要界面面板的关闭。",
 ["Passively polled via GroupTargeting.isTargetingActive to eliminate execution taint when targeting stops or gamepad mode is toggled."] = "通过 GroupTargeting.isTargetingActive 进行被动轮询，以消除停止目标选择或切换手柄模式时的执行污染。",
 ["Passively polled via GroupTargeting.isTargetingActive. Fires when the group targeting modifier is released."] = "通过 GroupTargeting.isTargetingActive 被动轮询。在释放队伍目标修改键时触发。",
 ["Patter frequency (Hz)"] = "雨滴轻拍频率 (Hz)",
 ["Perceptual S-Curve"] = "感知 S 型曲线",
 ["Performed an emote"] = "执行了表情动作",
 ["Personal damage clutter, footsteps, weather, world dialogs"] = "自身伤害干扰、脚步声、天气、世界对话",
 ["Physical strikes for weapon swings (main & off hand), auto-shot arrows, ability execution cadence, and completed and instant spellcasts."] = "武器挥动（主手与副手）、自动射击箭矢、技能施展节奏以及读条完成和瞬发法术的物理打击反馈。",
 ["Physical tool strikes: anvil hammer strokes, mining pickaxe impacts, tailoring stitches."] = "物理工具敲击：铁砧锤击、采矿镐击打、裁缝缝纫针线。",
 ["Pick a mode to test below."] = "在下方选择要测试的模式。",
 ["Picked up an item"] = "拿起物品",
 ["Ping placed"] = "已放置标记",
 ["Play"] = "播放",
 ["Play "] = "播放 ",
 ["Play %s right now with whatever's currently set on its sliders above."] = "立即以其上方滑块的当前设定播放 %s。",
 ["Play a few seconds of this texture at its current intensity. Module-driven preview reproducing authentic physical dynamics and configured intensity."] = "以当前强度播放数秒该材质震动。模块驱动的预览能够真实还原物理动态与配置强度。",
 ["Play this cue exactly as it is configured right now — its own intensity, and its own \"Feels like\" shape if you changed it. Works whether or not the cue is switched on, and needs a connected controller."] = "完全按照当前配置试听此提示——包括其自身的强度，以及你修改后的“体感”形态。无论该提示当前是否启用均可播放，需要连接手柄。",
 ["Polled from StaticPopup1..4's IsShown() four times a second rather than hooked. StaticPopup_Show is called from all over Blizzard's UI by code that then touches protected frames, and this addon already has one taint incident from exactly that shape (Modules/ControllerUI.lua's ActivateRadial note). Untested."] = "每秒轮询四次 StaticPopup1..4 的 IsShown() 而非采用钩子函数。StaticPopup_Show 会被暴雪界面多处随后涉及受保护框架的代码调用，本插件此前正因此模式产生过执行污染（详见 Modules/ControllerUI.lua 中的 ActivateRadial 说明）。未经充分测试。",
 ["Presence floor (low)"] = "最低存在感底限（重震）",
 ["Present whether or not you are moving, and it does not read your speed at all, so it keeps working while speed comes back as a secret value. Drives the SLOW motor, whose large mass is what buoyancy actually feels like, leaving the sharp one to \"Swimming resistance\" — so the two never collide. Floating gives you this alone."] = "无论移动与否均持续存在，且完全不读取移动速度，因此即便速度作为机密值返回时也能正常工作。主要驱动慢速重震马达（其较大的转动惯量能真实模拟水体浮力），将轻快马达留给“游泳阻力”——使二者互不冲突。静止漂浮时仅呈现此项效果。",
 ["Priest"] = "牧师",
 ["Prints every option you change and every cue that actually fires to chat, in real time. Same as /pulse debug — off by default, and resets to off on /reload since it's a testing aid, not a saved preference."] = "在聊天栏中实时输出你更改的每个选项以及实际触发的每个提示。等同于 /pulse debug——默认关闭，且在 /reload 后重置为关闭，因为此项仅为测试辅助工具，而非保存的偏好设置。",
 ["Produces no vibration — the controller is gone. Turning it off changes nothing you can feel: the engine clears in-flight vibration whenever it loses the device, because it has to."] = "不产生震动——手柄已断开。关闭此项不会带来任何体感变化：引擎在失去设备连接时必须清除所有正在执行的震动。",
 ["Profession skill increased"] = "专业技能提升",
 ["Profession window opened"] = "专业技能窗口已打开",
 ["Professions with a rhythm"] = "具有工作节奏的专业",
 ["Professions without one"] = "无工作节奏的专业",
 ["Profile"] = "配置文件",
 ["Profiles"] = "配置文件",
 ["Profiles and automatic rules"] = "配置文件与自动规则",
 ["Progression"] = "角色成长",
 ["Progressive low build leading to a sharp high break."] = "重震渐强积聚，随后爆发清脆的轻震碎裂。",
 ["Pull / glide balance"] = "拉力 / 滑翔平衡",
 ["Pulse"] = "Pulse",
 ["Pulse Haptics"] = "Pulse Haptics",
 ["Pulse is engineered to drive both the Low (heavy counterweight) and High (sharp tick) rumble motors in concert across all supported gamepads.\n\nVibration schemas define how logical haptic roles map to physical motors: **Standard Rumble** routes low-frequency signals to the heavy motor and high-frequency signals to the sharp motor; **High Motor Only** or **Low Motor Only** collapse signals when a motor is mechanically silent; and **Swapped / Inverted** reverses the mapping for custom grips."] = "Pulse 经过精心设计，可在所有受支持的手柄上协同驱动重震马达（慢速配重）与轻震马达（快速清脆）。\n\n震动方案定义了逻辑触觉角色如何映射到实体马达：**标准震动**将低频信号分配给重震马达，高频信号分配给轻震马达；**仅轻震马达**或**仅重震马达**在某个马达硬件损坏无声时合并信号；**对调 / 反转**则为特殊握持习惯反转映射关系。",
 ["Pulse is using |cffffd100%s|r, because a rule is set for %s."] = "Pulse 正在使用|cffffd100%s|r，因为已为 %s 设置了规则。",
 ["Pulse provides purpose-built default profiles engineered for specific roles and activities — browse them on the dedicated **Default profiles** page:\n\n• **Dungeon & Raid Roles** (Tank, Healer, Melee DPS, Caster DPS, Hunter) prioritize high signal-to-noise: threat loss, mitigations, kick windows, and spell completion ticks take priority over ambient clutter.\n• **World Immersion** (Melee, Caster, Ranged) maximizes atmospheric game-feel: footstep weight by armor type, mount strides, swimming resistance, weather, and exploration.\n• **PvP** delivers pure tactical radar with zero ambient distraction.\n\nOn the **Profiles** page, you can configure automatic rules that switch profiles on the fly when you change talent specializations, or create custom copies of any default profile. To protect combat performance, any profile switch requested while fighting is safely deferred until combat ends."] = "Pulse 为特定职责与游戏活动量身打造了默认配置文件——可在专门的**默认配置文件**页面中浏览：\n\n• **地下城与团队副本职责**（坦克、治疗、近战输出、远程法系输出、猎人）以高信噪比为核心：仇恨丢失、减伤覆盖、打断时机与施法完成提示优先于环境杂音。\n• **大世界沉浸**（近战、法系、远程）最大化烘托游戏氛围感：不同护甲类型的脚步重量感、坐骑步伐、游泳阻力、天气与探索反馈。\n• **PvP** 提供纯粹的战术雷达感知，杜绝环境干扰。\n\n在**配置文件**页面中，你可以配置自动化规则，以便在切换天赋专精时实时切换配置文件，或为任意默认配置创建自定义副本。为保障战斗流畅度，战斗中触发的任何配置切换请求都将安全推迟至脱战后执行。",
 ["Pulse tunes motor spin-up attack, coast-down release, and breakaway friction to match your physical hardware actuators."] = "Pulse 调校马达的起振起跑、减速释放与启动摩擦力，以精确匹配你的实体硬件震动致动器。",
 ["Pulse turns what's happening in the game into controller vibration — landing hard, gliding fast, taking a critical hit, a storm rolling in. It's texture for ordinary play, closer to what a console game's rumble does than to a notification.\n\nIt also carries a second, separate set of controls: a full accessibility toggle set imported from Tremor, this addon's sibling project. Those work the same way Tremor's own cues do — an event happens, one pulse tells you about it — but they share Pulse's channel with everything else here, which is a real difference worth understanding. See \"The Accessibility section\" below."] = "Pulse 将游戏中发生的一切转化为手柄震动——重重着陆、飞速滑翔、承受爆击、暴风雨来袭。它是日常游戏中的触感纹理，比起通知提示，它更接近主机游戏的原生手柄震动。\n\n它还包含第二套独立的控制选项：从其兄弟项目 Tremor 引入的完整辅助功能开关。这些提示与 Tremor 原生提示的工作方式相同——事件发生时以单次脉冲通知你——但它们与此处的所有其他功能共享 Pulse 的震动通道，这是一个值得理解的关键区别。请参阅下方的“辅助功能部分”。",
 ["Pulse: (Engine recorded %d errors. Last error: %s)"] = "Pulse: (引擎记录了 %d 个错误。最后错误：%s)",
 ["Pulse: /pulse test <mode>|heartbeat|warningbeat — try one of: "] = "Pulse: /pulse test <mode>|heartbeat|warningbeat —— 推荐尝试：",
 ["Pulse: activated profile \"%s\""] = "Pulse: 已激活配置文件“%s”",
 ["Pulse: active profile is \"%s\" (%s)"] = "Pulse: 当前配置文件为“%s” (%s)",
 ["Pulse: all haptic vibrations stopped."] = "Pulse：所有触觉震动已停止。",
 ["Pulse: bound profile \"%s\" to specialization %s"] = "Pulse: 已将配置文件“%s”绑定至专精 %s",
 ["Pulse: captured %s breakaway floor at %.3f (ramp was at %.3f when clicked)"] = "Pulse：捕获 %s 启转阈值于 %.3f（点击时渐变测试处于 %.3f）",
 ["Pulse: controller found, but it reports no usable name. Use Generic and Ramp each motor."] = "Pulse：检测到手柄，但其未报告可用名称。请使用通用手柄预设并对各马达进行渐变测试。",
 ["Pulse: controller reports itself as \"%s\", which isn't in the list. Use Generic and Ramp each motor."] = "Pulse：手柄报告其型号为“%s”，不在预设列表中。请使用通用手柄预设并对各马达进行渐变测试。",
 ["Pulse: could not build settings row %q (%s)"] = "Pulse: 无法构建设置行 %q (%s)",
 ["Pulse: could not build the settings window ("] = "Pulse: 无法构建设置窗口 (",
 ["Pulse: debug "] = "Pulse: 调试 ",
 ["Pulse: disabled all %d cues in active profile."] = "Pulse: 已禁用当前配置文件中的全部 %d 个提示。",
 ["Pulse: disabled all %d cues in profile \"%s\"."] = "Pulse: 已禁用全部 %d 个提示（配置文件“%s”）。",
 ["Pulse: disabled all %d cues in profile %s."] = "Pulse: 已禁用全部 %d 个提示（配置文件 %s）。",
