 ["Ramp"] = "递增",
 ["Ramps up in three steps, then releases."] = "分三步递增，随后释放。",
 ["Ranged auto-repeat started"] = "远程自动射击开始",
 ["Ranged auto-repeat stopped"] = "远程自动射击停止",
 ["Rapid staccato triple-click on the high motor."] = "轻震马达上快速断奏的三连击。",
 ["Rate of rain drops and micro-flutter patter."] = "雨滴敲击与细密颤动轻拍的频率。",
 ["Reading something"] = "正在阅读",
 ["Reads Blizzard's own default-UI LowHealthFrame (:IsShown()), not UnitHealth — that read is unconditionally secret, and the earlier color-curve attempt was confirmed dead too. LowHealthFrame's widget state is confirmed non-secret in-game instead. Very rarely can also fire for an unrelated reason (a fullscreen UI panel open in combat) — narrow enough to document rather than guard against. No `mode` field: this no longer plays a Core/Modes.lua shape, it drives Engine:Hold directly, same mechanism as lowHealthTexture."] = "读取暴雪原生界面的LowHealthFrame（:IsShown()），而非UnitHealth——后者属于无条件的私密数据读取，早期的颜色曲线方案也已确认失效。游戏内已证实LowHealthFrame的控件状态属于非私密数据。极罕见情况下可能因其他不相关的原因触发（例如在战斗中打开全屏界面面板）——发生几率极低，仅在此记录说明而未作防御性拦截。无`mode`字段：此项不再播放Core/Modes.lua中的形态，而是直接驱动Engine:Hold，机制与lowHealthTexture相同。",
 ["Reads Blizzard's own pre-scripted encounter timeline (C_EncounterEvents), not real-time combat data — pre-computed metadata, not something Secret Values blocks. No confirmed \"targeted at you\" flag: this can say something big is coming, not that it's coming for you specifically."] = "读取暴雪预设的首领战时间轴（C_EncounterEvents），而非实时战斗数据——这是预先计算好的元数据，不会被私密数据机制拦截。没有确认的“以你为目标”标识：它能提示重大技能即将到来，但无法判断是否专门针对你。",
 ["Reads CHAT_MSG_RAID_WARNING/MONSTER_YELL/MONSTER_EMOTE/MONSTER_WHISPER, gated on being inside an active encounter (ENCOUNTER_START/END) — never on C_EncounterEvents, so this works even if that namespace's data turns out unreliable. Occurrence-only: says a boss communicated something, not what or whether it's aimed at you. Known false-positive: a player manually using the raid-warning channel during a live pull also fires this — not filtered, since telling a boss-sent raid warning from a player-sent one isn't reliable."] = "读取CHAT_MSG_RAID_WARNING/MONSTER_YELL/MONSTER_EMOTE/MONSTER_WHISPER，以处于激活的首领战（ENCOUNTER_START/END）中为触发门控——从不依赖C_EncounterEvents，因此即便该命名空间的数据不可靠也能正常运作。仅检测事件发生：仅表明首领发送了信息，不包含具体内容以及是否针对你。已知误报情况：玩家在开怪战斗中手动使用团队警告频道也会触发此提示——未作过滤，因为区分首领发送与玩家发送的团队警告并不完全可靠。",
 ["Reads COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE's DAMAGE/SPELL_DAMAGE/DAMAGE_CRIT/SPELL_DAMAGE_CRIT messageTypes rather than UNIT_COMBAT, for no-churn reasons rather than necessity — UNIT_COMBAT's \"WOUND\" mechanism was believed dead (reported not firing 2026-09-15) but was confirmed live and firing on 2026-09-16 after all; this cue already worked on COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE by then, so it wasn't switched back. The suspicion that UNIT_COMBAT has been non-functional since Cataclysm-era patches should not be trusted as settled. Deliberately TICK, not THUD — a routine hit should read as noticeably gentler than critLanded's own pulse, not the same weight repeated constantly. Its own Intensity slider (the generic per-cue one every trigger gets) defaults to 0.3 rather than 1.0, same reasoning: it fires far more often than a crit or a dodge, so it needs to stay in the background rather than compete with them."] = "读取COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE的DAMAGE/SPELL_DAMAGE/DAMAGE_CRIT/SPELL_DAMAGE_CRIT消息类型，而非UNIT_COMBAT，这是出于避免无谓改动而非必要性——此前认为UNIT_COMBAT的“WOUND”机制已失效（2026-09-15报告未触发），但随后在2026-09-16证实它依然正常触发；彼时该提示已经在COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE上稳定工作，因此未切回。关于UNIT_COMBAT自大地的裂变补丁以来就失效的怀疑不应被视为定论。特意设计为【提示震动】而非【沉重打击】——常规受击在体感上应明显柔和于critLanded本身的脉冲，而不是反复承受相同重量的震动。其专属强度滑块（每个触发器通用的滑块）默认设为0.3而非1.0，同样基于该考量：它的触发频率远高于爆击或闪躲，因此需要保持在背景中而不喧宾夺主。",
 ["Reads COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE's FACTION messageType — same personal combat-text feed critLanded/damageTaken already use, occurrence-only, no amount or faction name read."] = "读取COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE的FACTION消息类型——使用与critLanded/damageTaken相同的个人战斗文字数据流，仅检测发生，不读取数值或阵营名称。",
 ["Reads COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE's HONOR_GAINED messageType — same personal combat-text feed critLanded/damageTaken already use, occurrence-only, no amount read."] = "读取COMBAT_TEXT_UPDATE的HONOR_GAINED消息类型——使用与critLanded/damageTaken相同的个人战斗文字数据流，仅检测发生，不读取数值。",
 ["Reads C_Weather.GetCurrentWeather() in WoW Forever. Modulates micro-flutter for rain, slow crystalline drift for snow, and dual rumble for sandstorms, scaled by weather intensity."] = "读取 WoW Forever 中的 C_Weather.GetCurrentWeather()。根据天气强度按比例调制：下雨表现为细密微颤，下雪表现为缓慢晶莹飘荡，沙尘暴表现为双马达深沉轰鸣。",
 ["Reads GetShapeshiftForm()/UPDATE_SHAPESHIFT_FORM, the player's own state — one generic cue for any change, not split by direction, since forms chain (e.g. Bear -> Cat -> Moonkin) without necessarily passing back through no-form in between."] = "读取玩家自身状态 GetShapeshiftForm()/UPDATE_SHAPESHIFT_FORM——任何形态变更均触发统一的通用提示，不区分变形方向，因为形态之间可连续切换（例如：熊形态 -> 猎豹形态 -> 枭兽形态），期间无需变回人形态。",
 ["Reads HEAL/PERIODIC_HEAL/HEAL_CRIT — same feed and direction caveat as healCrit above. Same TICK/0.3-intensity treatment as damageTaken, for the same reason: this fires far more often than a crit heal, especially under any HoT, so it stays in the background rather than competing with it."] = "读取HEAL/PERIODIC_HEAL/HEAL_CRIT——与上述healCrit享有相同的数据流与方向性说明。采用与damageTaken相同的【提示震动】及0.3强度设定，理由一致：它的触发频率远高于爆击治疗，尤其是在拥有持续治疗（HoT）的情况下，因此需要退居背景而不抢占主导。",
 ["Reads IsStealthed(), the player's own boolean state — not an aura scan, which would be both expensive and liable to return secret values. First cue built on Core/Waves.lua. Untested."] = "读取玩家自身的布尔状态IsStealthed()——而非光环扫描，后者开销大且易返回私密值。首个基于Core/Waves.lua构建的提示。未经测试。",
 ["Reads the segment's own IsEnabled() — the same value Blizzard reads to grey the highlight out, so this matches what you see on screen. Fires in place of \"Radial segment changed\", not alongside it."] = "读取该扇区自身的 IsEnabled()——与暴雪用于将高亮置灰的值完全相同，因此与你在屏幕上看到的完全一致。此提示会替代“轮盘扇区切换”触发，而非并列触发。",
 ["Reads the skill-up chat feed rather than SKILL_LINES_CHANGED, which also fires for unrelated skill-list changes. Occurrence-only, no text parsing — this says a skill went up, not which one or to what. Deliberately light: early profession levelling fires this constantly."] = "读取技能提升聊天信息流，而非 SKILL_LINES_CHANGED（后者在无关技能列表变更时也会触发）。仅检测事件发生，不解析具体文本——仅提示某项技能获得了提升，而不区分具体是哪项或升到了多少级。震感特意调得较轻微：在前期升级专业技能时会频繁触发。",
