 ["Reset"] = "重置",
 ["Reset calibration"] = "重置校准",
 ["Reset every mode's motor and duration multiplier back to 1.0? This can't be undone."] = "是否将所有模式的马达与持续时间倍率重置回 1.0？此操作无法撤销。",
 ["Reset every mode's motor and duration multiplier on this page back to 1.0. Doesn't touch cues, per-cue intensity, or per-trigger mode picks."] = "将本页面中所有模式的马达与持续时间倍率重置回 1.0。不会影响具体提示、单项提示强度或按触发器配置的模式选择。",
 ["Reset every motor's strength, floor, timing and curve back to the engine defaults? This can't be undone."] = "是否将每个马达的强度、启转阈值、时间节奏与响应曲线重置为引擎默认值？此操作无法撤销。",
 ["Reset motor & timing"] = "重置马达与时间节奏",
 ["Reset profile \"%s\" to defaults? Every cue, intensity and mode override in it goes back to stock values. This can't be undone."] = "是否将配置文件“%s”重置为默认值？其中的所有提示、强度以及模式覆盖都将恢复为初始值。此操作无法撤销。",
 ["Reset this profile"] = "重置此配置文件",
 ["Reset..."] = "重置...",
 ["Resources"] = "资源",
 ["Response curve"] = "响应曲线",
 ["Resting"] = "休息状态",
 ["Restricts the gait to mounted travel, where a sustained texture is most welcome. Turn off to feel your own footsteps too — try it before leaving it on."] = "将步态限制为骑乘行进，在骑乘状态下持续的材质纹理体感最为舒适。关闭此项亦可感知自身的步行脚步声——在决定常开之前不妨先试用体验。",
 ["Resurrection offered"] = "受到复活邀请",
 ["Reverses the rumble motors: heavy low-frequency thuds go to the High motor, and sharp high-frequency ticks go to the Low motor. For reverse-wired or custom controller grips."] = "反转震动马达：沉重的低频冲击分配至轻震马达，清脆的高频提示分配至重震马达。适用于反向接线或自定义握持方式的手柄。",
 ["Rewards"] = "奖励",
 ["Rhythmic footsteps on foot and hoofbeat cadence while mounted, weighted by armor class."] = "徒步时的节奏性脚步与骑乘时的马蹄踏鸣韵律，并根据护甲类型赋予不同重量感。",
 ["Riding a flight path"] = "乘坐飞行路线",
 ["Rising heartbeat pulse that quickens and intensifies as your breath meter runs low underwater."] = "水下呼吸量偏低时逐渐增强的心跳脉冲，随着呼吸耗尽而加快并加剧。",
 ["Rogue"] = "潜行者",
 ["Role poll"] = "职责确认",
 ["Rooted"] = "被定身",
 ["Routing & Schema"] = "路由与架构方案",
 ["Rules"] = "规则",
 ["Run Wizard"] = "运行向导",
 ["Run cadence (steps/s)"] = "奔跑踏步节奏 (步/秒)",
 ["Same fall-duration proxy as \"Landed\", just a higher threshold and a heavier mode."] = "与“着陆”采用相同的下落时长估算机制，仅具有更高的触发阈值和更厚重的震动模式。",
 ["Same polled mechanism as \"Confirmation popup appeared\". Untested."] = "与“确认弹出窗口出现”相同的轮询机制。未经测试。",
 ["Same source as weaponSwingMain above — PLAYER_SWING, filtered to the OffHand swing type. Silent if you're not dual-wielding. Parry haste has never affected off-hand timing, so that correction does not apply here even on the fallback estimator."] = "与上述weaponSwingMain数据源相同——PLAYER_SWING，按OffHand（副手）挥动类型过滤。未双持武器时保持静音。招架加速历来不影响副手攻击节奏，因此即便利使用后备估算器，此处也不应用该修正。",
 ["Same weight and shape as the vendor, mailbox and bank cues alongside it — all four are \"a window you walked up to has opened\", and they deliberately feel alike rather than each inventing a signature."] = "与一旁的商人、邮箱及银行提示具有相同的强度与体感形态——四者均属于“走到近前打开的交互窗口”，特意设计为相同的触觉体验，而非各自发明独立的手感模式。",
 ["Sandstorm / Gale intensity"] = "沙尘暴 / 大风强度",
 ["Save & Start Playing"] = "保存并开始游戏",
 ["Scales both the bed and the strikes for %s, before the two shared strengths above."] = "在上方的两个共享强度之前，按比例缩放 %s 的持续底震与敲击震颤。",
 ["Scales this cue on top of the overall intensity on the Pulse page."] = "在 Pulse 主页面的整体强度之上，按比例缩放此提示。",
 ["School lockouts are frequent in melee-heavy content. Off by default because a cue every kick you eat can crowd out the ones that mean you cannot act at all."] = "在近战较多的场景中法系封锁十分频繁。默认关闭，因为每次被踢断都产生震动提示可能会掩盖那些导致你完全无法行动的关键提示。",
 ["Scored by how long you were airborne, not by fall damage — that number is unreadable. A short hop stays silent below the threshold."] = "根据滞空时间长短进行评估，而非根据坠落伤害——该数值无法直接读取。短距离小跳低于阈值时保持静音。",
 ["Search %d cues..."] = "搜索 %d 个提示...",
 ["Second steepening point — the steepest segment of all, climbing to heartRateCritical by zero breath. Requested live 2026-09-16 as ~15% breath remaining."] = "第二个陡升点——所有分段中最陡峭的一段，在呼吸耗尽时攀升至heartRateCritical。于2026-09-16实机调优设定为剩余约15%呼吸。",
 ["Second-harmonic Stokes drift shaping. 0.0 is a pure symmetric sine wave; higher values create a sharp, steep crest and an elongated trough, matching real fluid gravity waves."] = "二阶谐波斯托克斯漂移波形塑造。0.0 为纯对称正弦波；数值越高会产生尖锐陡峭的波峰与拉长平缓的波谷，贴近真实的流体重力波。",
 ["Second-harmonic content, which is what makes a stroke feel like pull-then-glide rather than a symmetric swell. Six earlier tuning rounds all felt \"rough\" because they modulated the amplitude of a constant; a pure sine cannot express this asymmetry and that is most likely why. 0 reverts to a plain swell."] = "二次谐波成分，这正是赋予划水动作“发力划动-顺势滑行”不对称体感的核心，而非单调对称的起伏。前六轮调校体感均显“粗糙”，因为当时仅对常数振幅进行了调制；纯正弦波无法表现出这种不对称性，这极可能是原因所在。设为 0 将恢复为普通的单调波浪起伏。",
 ["Second: find out what your controller can do"] = "第二步：了解你的手柄性能",
 ["Secondary resource full"] = "次要资源已满",
 ["Seconds between drowning damage pulses while submerged with zero breath."] = "潜水呼吸归零后，溺水伤害脉冲之间的间隔秒数。",
 ["Sensory radar for survival: immediate physical warnings when taking damage, getting critically hit, deflecting attacks, being healed, receiving debuffs, threat changes, or losing control."] = "生存感知雷达：在受到伤害、遭受爆击、招架偏转攻击、获得治疗、受到减益效果、仇恨变化或失去控制时提供即时的实体预警。",
 ["Sensory spatial awareness when aiming and selecting units:\n• |cffffffffTarget Lock & Switch:|r Distinct click when acquiring a new target or cycling units.\n• |cffffffffFocus Target:|r Physical confirmation when assigning or swapping your focus target.\n• |cffffffffSoft Interaction:|r Tactile blip when your controller reticle aligns with an interactable NPC."] = "瞄准与选择单位时的空间感官反馈：\n• |cffffffff目标锁定与切换：|r获取新目标或循环切换单位时产生清晰的点击感。\n• |cffffffff焦点目标：|r设置或更换焦点目标时产生明确的确认震动。\n• |cffffffff软交互：|r手柄准星对准可交互NPC时产生触感提示。",
 ["Set Floor"] = "设定启转阈值",
 ["Set but not in force: |cffffd100%s|r. A more specific rule above is winning — clear it to let these take over."] = "已设置但未生效：|cffffd100%s|r。上方更具体的规则已生效——清除上级规则即可让此项生效。",
 ["Set for Spec"] = "为专精设定",
 ["Setup Summary"] = "设置概要",
 ["Shaman"] = "萨满祭司",
 ["Shapeshift form changed"] = "变形形态已改变",
 ["Shares its pulse pattern with the target cue. If your focus is also your target, you get one cue rather than two."] = "与目标提示共用相同的脉冲模式。若焦点同时也是你的当前目标，你只会感受到一次提示而非两次。",
 ["Shares its shape with \"Learned a new spell\" on purpose — both are the same moment to a player, just in different systems."] = "特意与“学会新法术”共享相同的震动形态——对玩家而言两者在体感上属于同一时刻，只是处于不同系统中。",
 ["Shares the social-pull limitation of the threat-rising cue."] = "与仇恨上升提示存在相同的社交拉怪局限性。",
 ["Sharp high kick layered with heavy low kick and rumble decay."] = "清脆的轻震冲量叠加沉重的重震冲量，并伴随渐弱余震。",
 ["Show a Play button on every cue"] = "在每个提示旁显示播放按钮",
 ["Show minimap icon"] = "显示小地图图标",
 ["Show per-cue detail controls"] = "显示单项提示的详细控制项",
 ["Shows only the page switches and this page. Every cue keeps its own settings; turn this off to get every page back exactly as it was."] = "仅显示页面总开关以及本页面。每个提示都会保留其各自的设置；关闭此项即可完全恢复所有页面的原貌。",
 ["Silenced"] = "被沉默",
 ["Simple view"] = "简洁视图",
 ["Simulates real fluid swell physics via harmonic wave synthesis: a slow, rhythmic rise into a steep wave crest, followed by a gentle glide into the trough. Driven primarily by the heavy slow motor with high-motor crest spray at peak amplitude. Automatically targets ocean and coastal waters unless configured to run in all swimming water."] = "通过谐波合成模拟真实流体涌浪物理效果：缓慢、有节奏地升至陡峭波峰，随后平稳滑入波谷。主要由慢速重震马达驱动，在振幅峰值处辅以轻震马达呈现浪花飞溅感。默认自动针对海洋与沿海水域生效，除非配置为在所有游泳水体中生效。",
 ["Skinning"] = "剥皮",
 ["Skyriding / Gliding Thrust"] = "驭龙术 / 滑翔推力",
 ["Slow, harmonic oceanic gravity swells and coastal tides while submerged in deep oceans."] = "潜入深海时，产生缓慢而和谐的海洋重力海涌与海岸潮汐感。",
 ["Slow, rhythmic breathing expansion wave keeping you aware of your stealth state."] = "缓慢且富有节奏的呼吸起伏波浪感，让你时刻感知当前的潜行状态。",
