 ["Step 3: World & Target Interactions"] = "步骤 3：世界与目标交互",
 ["Step 4: Interface & Social Alerts"] = "第 4 步：界面与社交警报",
 ["Step 5: Immersion & Continuous Textures"] = "第5步：沉浸感与持续震动材质",
 ["Step 6: Master Strength & Completion"] = "第 6 步：主强度与完成",
 ["Steps per second at full running speed. Scaled by how fast you are actually moving."] = "全速奔跑时每秒的踏步次数。根据你实际移动的速度进行动态缩放。",
 ["Steps per second at normal walking speed."] = "正常步行时每秒的踏步次数。",
 ["Strength"] = "强度",
 ["Strength at full swimming speed. Replaces the old swimLowPeak/swimHighPeak pair, which were blended with max() and were therefore algebraically one knob: the smaller never did anything."] = "全速游泳时的震动强度。替代了过去的 swimLowPeak/swimHighPeak 组合，旧方案通过 max() 混合，代数上实际等同于单个旋钮：较小的那个数值完全不起作用。",
