 ["Strokes per second at barely-moving speed."] = "在极慢微动速度下每秒的划水次数。",
 ["Strokes per second at full speed. Swimming faster strokes faster, not merely harder — the old version only ever changed amplitude."] = "全速游泳时每秒的划水次数。游得更快时划水频率亦会提升，而非仅仅增强力度——旧版本此前仅改变了震动幅度。",
 ["Stunned"] = "被昏迷",
 ["Subtle hydrostatic floating texture when swimming or bobbing in bodies of water."] = "在水体中游泳或漂浮时微妙的静水浮力纹理。",
 ["Summon offered"] = "受到召唤",
 ["Swapped / Inverted Rumble"] = "对调 / 反转震动",
 ["Swell depth"] = "海涌深度",
 ["Swell rate (Hz)"] = "海涌频率 (Hz)",
 ["Swell strength"] = "海涌强度",
 ["Swimming Resistance"] = "游泳阻力",
 ["Swimming resistance"] = "游泳阻力",
 ["Switch Pro Controller"] = "Switch Pro Controller",
 ["Switch to this profile"] = "切换至此配置文件",
 ["Switches every cue on the Casting page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一键开启或关闭“施法”页面上的所有提示。每个提示仍会保留其各自的底层设定。",
 ["Switches every cue on the Character & Status page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一键开启或关闭“角色与状态”页面上的所有提示。每个提示仍会保留其各自的底层设定。",
 ["Switches every cue on the Combat page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一次性开启或关闭“战斗”页面上的所有提示。每个提示在底层保留各自的独立设置。",
 ["Switches every cue on the Control & Threat page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一次性开启或关闭“控制与仇恨”页面上的所有提示。每个提示在底层保留各自的独立设置。",
 ["Switches every cue on the Controller Interactions page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一次性开启或关闭“手柄交互”页面中的所有提示。每个提示在其下保留各自独立的设置。",
 ["Switches every cue on the Interface & Accessibility page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一键开启或关闭“界面与辅助功能”页面上的所有提示。每个提示仍会保留其各自的底层设定。",
 ["Switches every cue on the Movement & Travel page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一键开启或关闭“移动与旅行”页面上的所有提示。每个提示仍会保留其各自的底层设定。",
 ["Switches every cue on the Social & Group page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一键开启或关闭“社交与队伍”页面上的所有提示。每个提示仍会保留其各自的底层设定。",
 ["Switches every cue on the Target & Focus page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一键开启或关闭“目标与焦点”页面上的所有提示。每个提示仍会保留其各自的底层设定。",
 ["Switches every cue on the World & Environment page on or off at once. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath."] = "一键开启或关闭“世界与环境”页面上的所有提示。每个提示仍会保留其各自的底层设定。",
 ["TRADE_SKILL_CRAFT_BEGIN via Core/CastActivity.lua. Untested — no crafting cue has ever existed in this addon, so nothing here has been felt. Off by default."] = "通过 Core/CastActivity.lua 捕获 TRADE_SKILL_CRAFT_BEGIN。未测试——此前本插件中从未存在制造提示，因此此处的效果尚无实测体感。默认关闭。",
 ["Tactile sensations for living in the world of Azeroth:\n• |cffffffffLoot Drops & Currency:|r Feel items and gold collected into your bags.\n• |cffffffffQuests & Turn-ins:|r Physical confirmation upon accepting and completing objectives.\n• |cffffffffProgression:|r Rewarding celebration pulses for leveling up, achievements, and XP gains."] = "畅游艾泽拉斯世界的触觉体验：\n• |cffffffff掉落战利品与货币：|r感知收入背包的物品与金币。\n• |cffffffff任务与交付：|r接取和完成目标时产生明确的实体确认感。\n• |cffffffff角色成长：|r升级、获得成就与获取经验值时产生令人振奋的庆祝脉冲。",
