 ["Targeting"] = "目标锁定",
 ["Tempo at zero breath remaining — the panic end of the climb, reached only in the final stretch below lateBreathThreshold."] = "剩余呼吸归零时的节奏——心率攀升的恐慌极点，仅在低于 lateBreathThreshold 的最后阶段触发。",
 ["Tempo from dangerStartThreshold down to midBreathThreshold — a real bradycardic rate (the diving reflex actually slows the heart at first, requested live 2026-09-16), not an elevated one."] = "从 dangerStartThreshold 降至 midBreathThreshold 期间的节奏——真实的心动过缓速率（潜水反射起初实际上会减慢心率，根据 2026-09-16 实机测试需求调整），而非心率上升。",
 ["Temporarily disabled: UNIT_PING_PIN_ADDED is registration-restricted by Blizzard on WoW Forever / 12.x."] = "暂时禁用：在 WoW Forever / 12.x 上，暴雪对 UNIT_PING_PIN_ADDED 限制了注册权限。",
 ["Test"] = "测试",
 ["Test Alert"] = "测试警报",
 ["Test Impact"] = "测试撞击",
 ["Test Lock"] = "测试锁定",
 ["Test Reward"] = "测试奖励",
 ["Test Rumble"] = "测试震动",
 ["Test Strike"] = "测试敲击",
 ["Test UI"] = "测试界面",
 ["Test the selected mode"] = "测试所选模式",
 ["Textures & Patterns"] = "材质纹理与模式",
 ["The Accessibility section"] = "辅助功能分类",
 ["The Cue Index directory"] = "提示索引目录",
 ["The _QUIET variant covers failures the game prints no error for, so this can fire with nothing visible on screen."] = "_QUIET 变体涵盖了游戏未输出错误信息的失败情况，因此在屏幕上没有任何可见提示时也可能触发。",
 ["The catch-all. Enum.PlayerInteractionType has 81 values and most are retail systems a classic-shaped roster never meets; anything unmapped lands here rather than being silent, which also means a window type added to the client later is covered with no change to Pulse. Turn it on with /pulse debug to find out which types your client actually sends. Untested."] = "通用兜底项。Enum.PlayerInteractionType 拥有 81 个枚举值，其中大多数属于经典旧世框架从未涉及的正式服系统；任何未明确映射的类型都会归入此处而非保持静音，这也意味着后续客户端若新增窗口类型，无需修改 Pulse 即可自动覆盖。可通过 /pulse debug 开启以查明你的客户端实际发送了哪些类型。未测试。",
 ["The effort of pulling yourself through water — a rhythmic hydrodynamic stroke that quickens and hardens with movement speed."] = "在水中划水前行的做功感——一种有节奏的流体水动力划击，随着移动速度加快而变得更为迅捷与坚实。",
 ["The experimental section"] = "实验性分类",
 ["The fallback for any character with no rule of its own — including characters you have not logged into yet. Set this to the profile you mostly want, then override the handful of characters that differ."] = "没有任何专属规则的角色的兜底配置——包含你尚未登录过的角色。建议将其设为你最常用的主要配置文件，随后只需为少数特殊角色单独覆盖规则即可。",
 ["The lightest possible tick when a conversation window opens with any NPC."] = "与任何 NPC 打开对话窗口时，产生最为轻微的提示震动。",
 ["The master switch for this page. Also on the Casting page, where the cue lives alongside the other casting cues."] = "本页面的总开关。同时也存在于“施法”页面中，与该页面中的其他施法提示并列。",
 ["The most promising cue here: a radial is an analog sweep through discrete stops, which is exactly what haptics are good at, and it's the one that could let you pick a segment without looking. Blizzard already change-gates this and applies its own stick hysteresis, so it should not fire continuously while you hold a direction. Untested whether the rate still feels like too much."] = "此处最具潜力的提示：轮盘是在离散卡点间进行模拟划动，这正是触觉反馈所擅长的领域，甚至能让你无需直视屏幕即可盲操选择扇区。暴雪已对此进行了变更过滤并内置了摇杆防抖迟滞，因此推住摇杆时不会持续连发。震动频率是否依然偏强尚待实测。",
 ["The other edge of the same CURSOR_CHANGED transition. Fires whether the item was placed somewhere or the drag was simply cancelled — the event doesn't distinguish, and nothing readable does."] = "同一 CURSOR_CHANGED 状态转换的另一端。无论物品是被放置到某处还是拖拽被单纯取消，均会触发——该事件本身无法区分，也没有任何可读取的接口能够区分。",
 ["The smallest value that makes this motor actually spin. Anything above zero is remapped into the range above this floor, so a quiet cue still moves the mass instead of dying silently. Zero input still means completely off. Use \"Ramp\" below to find your controller's real figure."] = "使该马达真正起动旋转的最小值。任何大于零的数值都会被重新映射至该阈值之上的区间，让微弱的提示仍能驱动配重起振，而非无声消逝。零输入仍表示完全静止。请使用下方的“渐变测试”获取你手柄的实际数值。",
 ["The standard authored baseline. Balanced game-feel across combat, environment, movement, and alerts."] = "官方标准基准配置。兼顾战斗、环境、移动与警报的平衡游戏体感。",
 ["The work itself while you craft — a bed for the length of it, with the profession's own rhythm struck on top. A hammer for blacksmithing, a pick for mining, nothing percussive for tailoring or enchanting."] = "制造过程中的劳作体感——全程伴有基底震颤，其上叠加该专业特有的劳作节奏。锻造时如铁锤敲击，采矿时如矿镐凿击，而裁缝或附魔则没有任何打击震感。",
 ["There is no way to detect which motors a controller actually drives — pick a schema above, then play a few modes to find out."] = "系统无法检测手柄实际能驱动哪些马达——请在上方选择一个震动方案，随后播放几个测试模式亲自确认。",
 ["These strike. The shape and the rate come from the craft — a hammer is slower and heavier than a pick — and the last blow lands on completion."] = "这些产生敲击震感。震动的形态与频率取决于制造类别——铁锤敲击比矿镐凿击更缓慢且沉重——最后一下重击在制造完成时落下。",
 ["This character"] = "当前角色",
 ["This character reports no specialization, so there is no per-specialization rule to set. The row appears by itself on a character that has one."] = "当前角色无专精信息，因此无可设置的专属专精规则。当角色拥有专精时该行将自动显示。",
 ["This specialization"] = "当前专精",
 ["This specialization ("] = "当前专精 (",
 ["This specialization (%s)"] = "此专精 (%s)",
 ["Threat"] = "仇恨",
 ["Threat loss/warning, heavy hits taken, defensive cooldowns, crowd control, enemy kick windows"] = "仇恨丢失/预警、承受重击、防御大招、群体控制、敌方打断时机",
 ["Threat lost"] = "失去仇恨",
 ["Threat rising"] = "仇恨上升",
 ["Threat, mitigations, and CC"] = "仇恨、减伤与控制技能",
 ["Three rhythmic thuds."] = "三次有节奏的沉重撞击。",
 ["Three-stage rising tension building on the low motor."] = "重震马达上呈现三段渐强的紧张感积蓄。",
 ["Thrill curve (high)"] = "俯冲快感曲线（轻震）",
 ["Thrill peak (high)"] = "俯冲快感峰值（轻震）",
 ["Time in seconds for a complete wave cycle. Real oceanic swells roll every 8 to 12 seconds (~0.10 Hz). Shorter periods feel like choppy coastal chop; longer periods feel like open-ocean rollers."] = "一个完整海浪周期的秒数。现实中的大洋涌浪每 8 到 12 秒涌动一次 (~0.10 Hz)。周期较短感觉像近岸波涛碎浪；周期较长感觉像远洋起伏巨浪。",
 ["Tracked cooldown ready"] = "追踪的冷却已就绪",
 ["Trade opened"] = "交易窗口已打开",
 ["Trainer window opened"] = "训练师窗口已打开",
 ["Triggers, modes, and motor tuning"] = "触发器、模式与马达调校",
 ["Try Texture"] = "测试震感",
 ["Tuned for HD Rumble voice-coil actuators"] = "专为 HD 震动音圈致动器调校",
 ["Tuned for heavy chassis damping (+10% Low motor gain)"] = "针对重机身阻尼进行调校（+10% 重震马达增益）",
 ["Tuned for trackpad & chassis LRA haptics"] = "专为触控板与机身 LRA 线性触觉马达调校",
 ["Turn off every cue in the active profile in one sweep (useful for quiet debugging)."] = "一键关闭当前配置文件中的所有提示（对静音调试非常实用）。",
 ["Turn on every cue in the active profile in one sweep (useful for testing/debugging)."] = "一键开启当前配置文件中的所有提示（对测试/调试非常实用）。",
 ["Turn whole pages of cues on or off. Each cue keeps its own setting underneath: switching a page back on restores exactly what was there."] = "整页开启或关闭提示。每个提示在底层均会保留各自的设置：重新开启页面将完全恢复之前的状态。",
 ["Two crisp ticks when a cooldown the built-in Cooldown Manager is tracking comes off cooldown."] = "内置冷却管理器追踪的技能结束冷却时，产生两次清脆的提示震动。",
 ["Two heavier hits with a gap between them."] = "两次较重的敲击，中间带有明显间隔。",
 ["Two kinds of trigger: pulses and textures"] = "两类触发器：脉冲与材质纹理",
 ["Two rhythmic thuds."] = "两次有节奏的沉重撞击。",
 ["Two separate addons exist alongside Pulse, each with its own slash command — neither is required, and neither changes anything Pulse itself does.\n\n**PulseChecklist** (/pulsecheck or /pcheck) opens a standalone checklist window listing every trigger, for tracking which ones you've actually confirmed feel right on your own hardware.\n\n**PulseDebug** (/pdebug or /pd) opens an interactive diagnostic window with live telemetry — inspect currently blended layers, monitor real-time channel output, review a timestamped event log, and inspect module states."] = "除了 Pulse 之外还存在两个独立的伴随插件，各自拥有专属的斜杠命令——两者均非必装，也不会改变 Pulse 本身的任何行为。\n\n**PulseChecklist**（/pulsecheck 或 /pcheck）可打开一个独立的检查清单窗口，列出所有触发器，用于追踪哪些提示已在你的硬件设备上确认体感良好。\n\n**PulseDebug**（/pdebug 或 /pd）可打开一个带有实时遥测数据的交互式诊断窗口——检查当前混合的震动层、监控实时通道输出、查看带时间戳的事件日志以及检查模块状态。",
 ["Two soft ticks when the action bar pages to a different set of abilities."] = "动作条翻页至另一组技能时，产生两次柔和的提示震动。",
 ["Two soft ticks when you page the radial left or right with the shoulder buttons."] = "使用肩键向左或向右翻动轮盘菜单时，产生两次柔和的提示震动。",
 ["Two soft ticks when you switch tabs inside a panel — Character, Spellbook, the map's zone tabs, and so on."] = "在面板内切换标签页时产生两次轻柔的提示震动——例如角色、法术书、地图的区域标签等。",
 ["Two solid hits when an item attaches to the cursor."] = "当物品附着在光标上时，产生两次沉稳的敲击震动。",
 ["Two solid hits when you mount."] = "上马时产生两次扎实的撞击感。",
 ["Two taps when the guild bank opens — heavier than the personal bank, because it is a bigger door."] = "公会银行打开时产生两次轻触震动——比个人银行更厚重，因为那是一扇更大的门。",
 ["UI focus moved"] = "界面焦点移动",
 ["UI navigation hit an edge"] = "界面导航触碰边缘",
 ["UI panel closed"] = "界面面板已关闭",
 ["UI panel opened"] = "界面面板已打开",
 ["Underwater boost"] = "水下增益",
 ["Underwater breath texture"] = "水下呼吸纹理",
 ["Untested whether this also fires on every instant-cast press rather than only real cast-bar completions — if so, it'll feel far too frequent to read as \"that landed\" specifically. Check before relying on it."] = "未经测试每次按下瞬发技能是否也会触发，而非仅在实际施法条读条完成时触发——若是前者，震动将过于频繁而无法准确传达“技能命中”的反馈。依赖此项前请先进行验证。",
 ["Untested — the interruptedBy value itself is confirmed against Blizzard's own casting-bar code, not live. What's NOT confirmed: whether interruptedBy comes back secret for your own channel (the event is flagged SecretWhenUnitSpellCastRestricted in Blizzard's API docs). If this never fires, that's the first thing to check, not a sign the logic above is wrong."] = "未经测试——interruptedBy数值本身已对照暴雪自身的施法条代码进行核对，但未在实机中验证。尚未确认的是：对于你自己引导的法术，interruptedBy是否会作为私密数据返回（该事件在暴雪API文档中被标记为SecretWhenUnitSpellCastRestricted）。如果该提示从未触发，应首先检查这一点，而非意味着上述逻辑有误。",
 ["Untested."] = "未经测试。",
 ["Untested: this fires for a Skyriding ascend too, on top of glideThrust's own continuous texture easing in right after — may read as a clean \"liftoff, then flight\" or as a double-hit. Try it before assuming either."] = "未测试：该项在驭龙术升空时亦会触发，紧接着叠加 glideThrust 自身的持续纹理平滑介入——体感上可能是干净利落的“起飞后飞行”，也可能表现为双重撞击。在妄下定论前不妨亲自体验。",
 ["Urgent repeating cardiac 'lub-dub' rhythm in sync with screen warnings below 20% health."] = "生命值低于20%时，与屏幕警告同步的急促循环心脏“砰-咚”（lub-dub）搏动节律。",
 ["Use the old estimator"] = "使用旧版估算算法",
 ["Use when the high motor produces nothing you can feel at all. Everything collapses onto the low motor. If it works but is just weak, use Standard and raise its Strength on the Controller calibration page instead."] = "当轻震马达完全无法感受到任何震动时使用。所有信号将合并至重震马达输出。如果该马达能工作只是偏弱，请改用标准方案并在“手柄校准”页面调高其强度。",
 ["Use when the low motor produces nothing you can feel at all. Everything collapses onto the high motor. If the low motor works but is just weak, use Standard and raise its Strength on the Controller calibration page instead."] = "当重震马达完全无法感受到任何震动时使用。所有信号将合并至轻震马达输出。如果该马达能工作只是偏弱，请改用标准方案并在“手柄校准”页面调高其强度。",
 ["Uses WoW Forever's native C_SwingTimer range checking."] = "使用 WoW Forever 原生的 C_SwingTimer 距离判定。",
 ["Using \"%s\" — set for %s."] = "正在使用“%s”——已为 %s 设定。",
 ["Vault door closed"] = "金库大门已关闭",
 ["Vendor window opened"] = "商人窗口已打开",
 ["Verify controller connection and motor calibration:"] = "验证手柄连接与马达校准：",
 ["Vibration Mode"] = "震动模式",
 ["Vibration Schema: |cffffd100%s|r"] = "震动架构方案：|cffffd100%s|r",
 ["Vibration schema"] = "震动架构方案",
 ["Visceral physical game-feel. Armor-weighted footstep gait, terrain landings, parry and block impacts, swimming drag, weather, and rich world looting."] = "拳拳到肉的实体游戏体感。按护甲重量区分的脚步步伐、地形着陆、招架与格挡撞击、游泳阻力、天气与丰富的世界拾取触感。",
 ["Voice-coil actuators (LRA), ultra-low 0.025 floor, instant response"] = "线性音圈致动器 (LRA)，0.025 超低起振阈值，瞬时瞬态响应",
 ["Walk cadence (steps/s)"] = "步行踏步节奏 (步/秒)",
 ["Warlock"] = "术士",
 ["Warning lead time"] = "警报提前量",
 ["Warrior"] = "战士",
 ["Watches UNIT_TARGET and target swaps for hostile units whose target is the player. Uses UnitIsUnit('targettarget', 'player') with defensive secrecy guards."] = "监测 UNIT_TARGET 以及目标切换，追踪以玩家为目标的敌对单位。使用 UnitIsUnit('targettarget', 'player') 并带有防御性私密保护。",
 ["Water presence"] = "水体存在感",
 ["Wave cycle (seconds)"] = "海浪周期 (秒)",
 ["Wave period (sec)"] = "海浪周期 (秒)",
 ["Wave steepness"] = "海浪波陡度",
 ["Weapon or gear swapped"] = "更换武器或装备",
 ["Weapon swing (main hand)"] = "武器挥动（主手）",
 ["Weapon swing (off hand)"] = "武器挥动（副手）",
 ["Weapon swings, ability cadence, and auto-attack stops"] = "武器挥动、技能节奏与自动攻击停止",
 ["Weather Atmosphere"] = "天气氛围",
 ["Weather changed"] = "天气已变更",
 ["Weather texture"] = "天气纹理",
 ["Weather, footsteps, loot popups, quest dialogs, merchant/mail"] = "天气、脚步声、拾取弹窗、任务对话、商人/邮件",
 ["What the game is doing, felt through the controller."] = "游戏中发生的一切，皆可通过手柄亲身感知。",
 ["What this does"] = "功能说明",
 ["When mobs are pulled socially — aggroing because a neighbour was pulled — the game often reports status 0 even though you have aggro."] = "当怪物被连锁引怪拉脱时（因附近的怪物被引而获得仇恨），游戏往往报告仇恨状态为 0，即便你实际上持有仇恨。",
 ["When set to 1, restricts the rolling swell to ocean bodies, coasts, seas, and deep-water fatigue zones (English clients only; non-English clients play swell in all swimming water). Set to 0 to feel ocean swells in all swimming water."] = "设置为 1 时，仅在海洋、海岸、海域与深水力竭区域呈现起伏涌浪（仅限英文客户端；非英文客户端将在所有游泳水体中播放涌浪）。设置为 0 时可在所有游泳水体中感受海洋涌浪。",
 ["Which controller is this?"] = "当前是哪款手柄？",
 ["Which controller you are holding. Picking one changes nothing on its own — press Apply below to load its starting values. These are starting points reasoned from what kind of actuators each controller uses, not measurements: Ramp is what measures YOUR controller, and whatever you enter afterwards wins."] = "你当前所握持的手柄。仅选择此项不会生效——需点击下方的“应用”以加载其初始预设值。这些是根据各款手柄搭载的执行器类型推导的初始起点，而非实测值：“渐变测试”才能测量出属于你个人手柄的实际数据，且随后手动填入的数值拥有最高优先级。",
 ["Which of the preset shapes this specific cue plays when it fires. \""] = "此提示触发时播放哪种预设震动形态。“",
 ["Which physical motors each cue drives. Start with Standard Rumble, then calibrate the motors below."] = "每个提示驱动哪些实体马达。建议从“标准震动”开始，然后在下方校准马达。",
 ["Which physical motors each trigger drives. Try one, test a mode below, keep the one you can feel."] = "每个触发器驱动哪些实体马达。尝试一种并测试下方的模式，保留你能清晰感知的设置。",
 ["Which profile to use right now. This writes to whichever rule is currently in force, so picking here always changes what you are actually using rather than editing a rule something more specific is overriding."] = "当前使用的配置文件。这会直接写入当前生效的规则，因此在此选择始终会改变你实际使用的配置，而不会编辑被更高优先级规则覆盖的内容。",
 ["Which saved cue configuration is active on this character. Every cue's on/off, its intensity and its mode override belong to the profile picked here; the master switch, the schema and the calibration stay global."] = "当前角色处于激活状态的已保存提示配置。每个提示的启用/禁用、强度及其模式覆盖均归属于此处选定的配置文件；总开关、震动方案与校准数据则保持全局通用。",
 ["Whisper received"] = "收到密语",
 ["Wind amplitude"] = "风力振幅",
 ["Wind resistance & thrust surge while flying. Scales dynamically with your flight speed."] = "飞行时的风阻与推力涌动。根据飞行速度动态缩放。",
 ["Windfury (spellcast hook)"] = "风怒（施法钩子）",
 ["Windfury (swing burst)"] = "风怒（挥动爆发）",
 ["Windfury extra attacks"] = "风怒额外攻击",
 ["Windows"] = "窗口",
 ["With dozens of cues across movement, combat, environment, and interface systems, you might know what you want to adjust without knowing which tab owns it.\n\nThe **Cue index** page lists every cue in Pulse alphabetically, grouped under clean letter headers with real-time status dots showing whether each cue is currently enabled. Clicking any line jumps directly to that cue's page and settings.\n\nSearching the Cue Index searches all cue names, descriptions, and locations simultaneously, serving as an instant directory across the entire addon."] = "移动、战斗、环境与界面系统涵盖数十种提示，你可能清楚自己想调整什么，却不知道它归属于哪个分页。\n\n**提示索引**页面按字母顺序罗列了 Pulse 中的每个提示，归类于整洁的字母标题下，并带有实时状态圆点指示各个提示当前是否已启用。点击任意行可直接跳转至该提示的专属页面与设置。\n\n在提示索引中搜索将同时检索所有提示名称、描述及所在位置，成为贯穿整个插件的即时速查目录。",
 ["With this turned off, navigation, edge bumps, radial wheels, tab switches, and popups produce no haptics and unhook from the interface to save processing."] = "关闭此项后，界面导航、边界撞击、轮盘菜单、标签页切换及弹窗将不再产生触觉震动，并会从界面中注销 Hook 钩子以节省处理资源。",
 ["Work down this list in order.\n\nIs controller support on? See the first section — this is by far the most common cause.\n\nDoes the controller vibrate at all? Test a mode from the panel. If that's silent, the problem is the controller or the game, not your settings.\n\nIs Pulse switched on, and is the trigger you're waiting for switched on? Both have to be — and for an Accessibility trigger, check the section's master switch too, if it has one.\n\nIs it a texture rather than a pulse? Textures only run while their cause is actually happening — nothing to feel while standing still.\n\nIs the motor's breakaway floor too low? Some gamepads require a higher minimum floor to overcome mechanical inertia. Check the **Controller calibration** page and test the motor ramp."] = "请按顺序依次排查以下各项。\n\n手柄支持是否开启？请参见第一小节——这是迄今为止最常见的原因。\n\n手柄是否有任何震动？请在面板中测试一个模式。如果毫无反应，问题出在手柄或游戏本身，而非你的插件设置。\n\nPulse 是否开启，且你正在等待的触发器是否也已开启？两者必须同时处于开启状态——如果是辅助功能触发器，若该分组设有总开关，也需一并检查。\n\n它是震动材质还是脉冲？材质震动仅在其成因实际发生时才会持续运行——静止站立时没有任何体感。\n\n马达的启转阈值是否设置过低？部分手柄需要更高的最低阈值来克服机械惯性。请查看**手柄校准**页面并测试马达渐变。",
