 ["World of Warcraft ignores controllers entirely until you turn them on, and this is off by default. Pairing the controller to your computer is not enough — the game has to be told separately.\n\nType this into chat, then restart the game:\n\n    /console GamePadEnable 1\n\nUntil that is done nothing here can work, and nothing will warn you. If Pulse seems completely dead, check this first."] = "《魔兽世界》在手动开启手柄支持之前会完全忽略手柄，且该功能默认处于关闭状态。仅仅将手柄与电脑配对是不够的——必须在游戏中单独启用。\n\n请在聊天框中输入以下命令，然后重启游戏：\n\n    /console GamePadEnable 1\n\n在完成此操作前，本插件的所有功能均无法工作，且系统不会弹出任何警告。如果 Pulse 看起来完全毫无反应，请首先检查此项。",
